<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jawb</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jawb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jawb</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jawb</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai, now arui khin dow 2,100-1,900 BC takra kowi naown padow tawngbak mih maru ka tuak chekhai. Tawkche achima amiapaw nowngia tek dowi chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow anowmma hai achinawmma Jawb takham mih hai kham ngare mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi. Mami bowih hownia dow ngare dawng kowi Jawb town sak mih hai Thurai saksing sanara lawnguan kowi arui uowi. Mami bowih kowi dow Judauüa lawnguan, Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa ka lawngra mih lawnguan hai Mosi kowh ari aiang lawnguan kowi arui uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jawb kowh dow tawncher uowi ahuma chekhai. Aia dow ning ahuma singla khai. Aia kowh chownglawng dow Abraham chowng khe kowh chownglawng iawng chekhai. Jawb dow Abraham dowi rawn kowh maru pami chanlai miuüa rik tekla mih hownia a-i tuk chekhai. Jawb uowi mih dow Persia pren tawngphak pra kowh Arawb pren kowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hebrai lai hown kowh ruiah mih Jawb pami bowih dow meng iawng hown ruiah khai. Nami bowih kowi dow Jawb kowh auiua uowi tali ia chekhai. Naiawngün dow Elifaz, Bildad, Zofar hai Elihu büah chekhai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi sum ia mih dow aningma kangowh chekhai. Jawb kowh auiuauüa dow laiklow hown Jawb kowi peah akrat ngamlam chekhai. Tawkche akung kowi dow Thurai mih amatni bowkbowk kowi uang klangah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami khin khe dow Jawb mih Thurai tut-e khamsum khamdaw khai bowt, now aia dow aia tawita mata mih hownia tarip hanow Thurai tut-e lü lawt khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow Thurai mih aia kowi plan peah iungra khai. Nakhowk khe dow aia mih alai kowh aia chownglawng kowi kowh iung mih lak-e lang iung khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Setan: Setan pami dow maru ngak lowk ia chekhai. Aia dow süngnam mang iawng chekhai. Aia dow Thurai kowh ransu chekhai. Aia dow Thurai kowh naukrang krawi piak reng mih maru ngak lowk ia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Achinawmma: Achinawmma pami dow Thurai ana pek iawng chang mih hai uowi mih chekhai. Thurai mik kowi achinawmma lusa maru miapaw uowi dowi. Nachenganchepaw Isu Krista kowi owm miuüa dow Thurai mik kowi achinawmma ia chowng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Saratchowh : Saratchowh pami dow u-pa uowi dowi mih ngeuüa kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Leviathan: Leviathan pami dow sata kowi kowh uowi mih rua mang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Jawb luk kowi chaingra uang ting mih 1:1-2:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Jawb hai aia auiuauüa 3:1-31:40</para>
  <para style="io2">Thurai tut-e Jawb chawk lai mih 3:1-26</para>
  <para style="io2">Jawb hai auiuauüa kowh laiklow lowk 4:1-14:22</para>
  <para style="io2">Jawb hai auiuauüa kowh laiklow pre 15:1-21:34</para>
  <para style="io2">Jawb hai auiuauüa kowh laiklow sum 22:1-27:23</para>
  <para style="io2">Chanlaira lawnguan kowi Jawb kowh laiklow 28:1-28</para>
  <para style="io2">Jawb kowh achur laiklow 29:1-31:40</para>
  <para style="io1">Elihu kowh laiklow 32:1-37:24</para>
  <para style="io1">Jawb kowi Thurai klangah mih 38:1-42:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Achur amowi kowi kowh laiklow 42:7-17</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Jawb hai aia kimchak lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Uz pren kowi Jawb pami maru uowi lowk ia. Aia dow achinawmma hai anowmma mih maru chekhai. Aia dow Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kram mih hai chang lup ngak dowi mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Aia kowh dow chapa uowi ranit ia hai chama uowi sum ia chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Nami klen kowi aia kowh tawncher ün paw ruapur 7,000 pum, ut 3,000 pum, chiala 500 chum hai kawrngaramchükma 500 pum uowi chekhai. Now aia kowh narla narma paw akawmma chekhai. Satlawt pra kowh prenchakuüa pungmadawng kowi lang kureng mih dow aia towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Aia kowh chapauüa dow tavir lutlut amatni chowlowkkow kim kowi chakkham pawi kamrüt büah reng. Now amatni kowh tuamow sum ia kowi paw amatni hown nauang tawi taiua cha chakkham kownkow kowchin pe maru hanow hawla büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Amatni kowh chakkham pawi ki sun kung kowi a-pa Jawb mih amatni kowi hawah reng chekhai. Now aia dow murpa awr rü hanow achauüa kowi nachimsaiah kownkow chang pe tikah mih uanap pawi reng chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tatuak mih, “Ang chauüa changta ngak khai chepaw naia, now sak hownia Thurai kowi tek naklak khai chepaw naia,” pakhai. Jawb dow naiawng atungma chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jawb luk kowi kowh chaingra uang rik ting mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Akat khe kramamu-uüa mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uang takua talawm khai, now <char style="w">Setan</char> paw amatni hown uang tawi takua talawm khai. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Setan mih, “Tawng hownia chow en uang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Now CHAKRAMANG kowi Setan klangah mih, “Lusa kowi iupra lai paipra lai cham krawi lenla kowh ang uang mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Setan mih, “Ang kowh nar Jawb prakowi en tang mü tak bow? Lusa kowi aia iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow achinawmma hai anowmma mih maru chekhai. Aia dow Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kram mih hai chang lup ngak dowi mih maru chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi Setan tek pe mih, “Jawb ringkaw en mih hai kram en mih aiawnglowma snü bow? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Aia hai aia kowh kimchakuüa kowi hown aia kowh dawngthawnguan kowi atungma en mingkhet pe reng chekhai. Aia changah mih lup kowi dow en peah prasi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh tawncher ün dow pren kowi tangia khai bowt. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Tawkche aia kowh uowi mih maten kawmat sam piakta pe bowk madiah. Nahanow aia mih en pur kowi nape en piati kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Nakhowk khe Setan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ow, aia kowh uowi mih maten napawta pe kown mih ana ang peta en khowk. Tawkche aia buk kowi bütchow khowm en naia kak kown nadowi,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow Setan mih CHAKRAMANG pur hownia powt khai.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Akat khe Jawb kowh chauüa dow ataimow kim kowi cha chakkham hai kham grep tui khai. <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />Nami khin khe Jawb kowi nauang phowng pe satang kownkow maru uang lowk ia khai, now nami maru tek pe mih, “En kowh chiala hawmh thawn laih chowdiah, now kawrngaramchük hawmh paw aria kowi taw chak chowdiah. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Nami khin khe Sebea chenchapuüa mih uangah hanow naiawngün tawncher maten pawla bowk khai. Now en kowh naruüa kowi paw saila bowk khai. En kowi nauang phowng en satang kown mih ang towbowt ta plai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Nami satang phowng mih tek lai reng tak khe maru uang plan ting lowk ia khai. Nami maru tek pe Jawb mih, “Mukuang hownia Thurai kowh maih mih uang kla hanow en kowh naruüa kowi hailawm ruapur hai rua hawmh kowi uang kamta bowk khai. En kowi nauang phowng en satang kown mih ang towbowt ta plai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Nami maru tek lai reng tak khe maru uang plan ting lowk ia khai iawk. Nami maru tek pe Jawb mih, “Kaldaiuüa mih uang sum thum hanow en kowh ut mih pawla bowk khai, now en kowh naruüa kowi paw saila bowk khai. En kowi nauang phowng en satang kown mih ang towbowt ta plai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Nami maru tek lai reng tak khe maru uang plan ting lowk ia khai iawk. Nami maru paw Jawb kowi tek pe mih, “En kowh chapauüa mih ataimow kim kowi cha chakkham hai kham grep tui thüm chowdiah. <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />Nakhowk khe süngrüp süngkangma hownia li akürma uang hanow kim mih uang piakta khai. Nami kim dow amatni luk kowi uang dowh hanow kowng büah bowk khai. En kowi nauang phowng en satang kown mih ang towbowt ta plai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Jawb mih awr rü khai bowt. Now sak kowi rau lai kowh aiamat kowh tawnguat mih thekah kruang khai, now aia kowh sam paw khaita khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se ringkawma hown Thurai kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />“Ang uang dia khe tawngpaw ang uang pawla dowi chekhai; ang mang khe paw tawngpaw ang napawla kown nadowi. Ang kowh dawngthawnguan pe ang mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih, now pawta mih paw CHAKRAMANG chowtaih. CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pacham uowi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Naiawng phaw chenganchepaw Jawb dow chang angak dowi chekhai, now Thurai kowi paw peah ngak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Jawb luk kowi chaingra uang plan ting mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Now pakat khe paw kramamu-uüa mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi takua talawm khai iawk. Nakhowk khe paw Setan mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi tawi uowi kownkow kramamu-uüa hown uang tawi khai iawk. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Setan mih, “Tawng hownia chow en uang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Nakhowk khe Setan klangah mih, “Lusa kowi iupra lai paipra lai cham krawi lenla kowh ang uang mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Setan mih, “Ang kowh nar Jawb prakowi en pela ching tak bow? Lusa kowi aia iawng mih maru miapaw uowi dowi bowt. Aia kowh dow tawng iawng mih angak paw uowi dowi chekhai, now aia dow achinawmma chekhai. Aia dow ringkawma hown kram ang reng, now angak hownia alakma lang uowi reng chekhai. Tawngpaw auan uowi dowi matchang aia kowi napiakah kownkow ang tut-e en uang chawk towkah khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat pat aia mih chang angak dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Nakhowk khe Setan plan klangah mih, “Aia kowh sak mih aia tut-e lang pankri chekhai; lusa maru mih kowmatia kowh sak naplaila kownkow aia kowh uowi mih maten uam pe chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />En kowh rut parah hanow aia kow kowi sam peah arau madiah; aia mih en pur kowi nape en piati hanow nape en rukrai ngengche kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Setan mih, “Ow, aia kowi mih en rut kowi ang apta en khowk. Tawkchedow aia kowh sak mih en naia paw pe kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Nami kung kowi dow Setan mih CHAKRAMANG pur hownia lawt khai, now Jawb kowi mih lunui hownia khawkpha mowr arauma mih ma hown pe ngareah khai. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Nakhowk khe Jawb mih plawi dawng kowi chowm hanow bawn kawng sek hown takuar saklak khai.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Nakhowk khe Jawb kowi amasi tek pe mih, “Kawmat paw achinawmma mih maru nachowng kown en kamrüt reng tak bow? Thurai kowi pela angak now kowng prang bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Nachenganchepaw amasi kowi Jawb tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow sangching uowi dowi mih masiuüa iawng en tuk tek khai? Thurai hownia aiung krowngchow taih bow achi paw kown; angak dow achi paw dowi bowt ü?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Naiawng phaw chepaw Jawb mih dow aia kowh sangprowk laitek hown chang angak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi a-auiua sum ia uang müah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Now naiawng Jawb luk kowi phih uang ting mih satang dow Jawb kowh auiua sum ia mih paw tawi ta khai bowt. Nami satang tata hanow amatni dow Jawb kowi nauang peah sakklamra hanow tawi kar tawi nguk kownkow amatni chowlowkkow kim hownia akrowksang uang tarü khai. Amatni sum ia kowi lowk ia mih dow Teman chenchap Elifaz, alowk mih dow Suhite chenchap Bildad, now alowk mih dow Naman chenchap Zofar chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Amatni dow alakma hownia Jawb kowi khi hanow tuk mat dowi chekhai. Amatni dow atün atünma kar khai, now kowmatia kowh tawnguat mih sekta büah hanow mukuang prakowi uet dinchow büah khai. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Nami kung kowi dow ranit ni ranit uar mowr Jawb hown bawn dawng kowi tawi chowm büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni pungmadawng hownia miapaw Jawb kowi tawngpaw tek pe dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mün khowt chow Jawb ngare mih khi büah bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Jawb rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1-2" />Nami kung kowi dow Jawb mih tarowng lai tek khai bowt. Aia dow aia kowh dia ni kowi maiawng hai peah piati khai:<verse eid="JOB 3:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Ang kowh dia ni mih pacham piak prang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">Au apa thawp ang mih iak dow pacham piak prang lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Nami ni dow aiiuma pacham phaw lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">nami ni dow katpaw hang pacham ka anowi tham bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">now nami ni kowi dow Thurai mih pacham tamata prang lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Nami ni dow iiu chamang iiu mih ni pacham chowng lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">aia kowi dow uangnim pacham mumta klum lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">now nami ni aiiuma mih kowi dow kramra pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Nami iak dow iiu chamang pacham iiu lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ning kowi kowh ni maten pungmadawng kowi nami ni dow hang pacham klowkla lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">now la kowi kowh ni maten kowi paw nami ni dow hang pacham tawi uowi lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Nami iak dow ka chah dowi mih masiuüa iawng pacham chowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">nami iak kowi dow tawng iawng mih awmrawm meng paw hang pacham ta lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Ni ün nangala kownkow chang mantan miuüa dow nami ni kowi pacham pe piati lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">mantan hown Leviathan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Leviathan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow sata kowi kowh uowi mih rua mang chekhai.</char></note> kowi nowng krüng miuüa nami ni kowi pacham peah piati lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Nami iak khe kowh krek maten dow pacham iiu bowk lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">nami iak hawt chawng anowi mih dow aiawnglowma pachowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">now rau pra kowh anowi mih nami iak hang pacham khi lah.<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami iak dow au kowh chah ruih pitta pe dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">now akrat pusara ang nakhi kown mih hownia henta ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />“Tawngplawng kowchow mu lak kowi uowi reng tak khe ang cham kowng prang dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">Nadowi now tawngplawng kowchow uang dia hown krowksang ang kowng prang dowi?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow au downg lak kowi ang tuk ka tapai khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">Tawngplawng kowchow aia kowh iawn tui au tuk pe kham ang khai?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Naiawng nadowi e dow thaulangma kawmat ang mawk phülü bowt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">now ang ka ipmüi hai ang ka tanai phülü bowt diah.<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />Alai kowh kim iung thawp mih manguüa hown ang cham tanai phülü bowt diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">mang prengia pek miuüa hown ang cham uowi phülü bowt diah.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Tai hown kowh thawp kim mih alai kowh pren kruitown miuüa hown ang tawi uowi phülü bowt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">now kuh ahuma uowi miuüa hown ang tawi uowi phülü bowt diah.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />U mu lak kowi kowng kowh khila sat nowi dowi mih chah iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">tawngplawng kowchow krawng dawng kowi cham dupta ang hüah dowi?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Krawng dawng kowi dow maru ngakuüa paw krawi pusa dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">now kawm miuüa paw ka tanai phülü chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Nar kowi uowi miuüa paw nakowi dow asowrma ka uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">now krawi chang nowng miuüa kowh nang klow paw nakowi dow ta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Nakowi mih maru iuk maru sowm uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">now naruüa paw kim iah nowng changra hownia ka thaulangra bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />“Tuak kawm tuak krat hown uowi miuüa kowi tawngplawng kowchow pe khi-ah anowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">now chownglawng kowi ngare kangowh miuüa kowi tawngplawng kowchow pe singah khai?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Amatni dow kowng kown nau chepaw ka kowng dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">amatni dow asung khakma mih uanh lak-e kowng kowi nau chepaw ka dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Amatni dow tadupra kuam kowi ia ting now awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">now tadupra kowi ia ting rakowi lainowmma piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Sakowmra uowi dowi miuüa kowi tawng rakowi chow Thurai tuk peah chownglawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">naiawng mih maru kowi tawngplawng kowchow pe singah khai?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Ang kowh sak hü kawm mih dow chowng ang kowh chakkham khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">ang kowh nguk klow dow tui takhük plawtlawt mih iawng towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Ang kramah mih chap maten dow ang luk kowi uang kla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">naiawng naphaw kown ang kramah nowm nowm mih dow ang luk kowi uang ting khai.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Ang kowh thaulangra uowi dowi; ang ka tanai dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">now ang kowh akrat pusara mih katpaw akhowk uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Elifaz rik klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Jawb kowh laiklow tata hanow Teman chenchap Elifaz dow Jawb kowi klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />“Jawb, ang klang en e dow en sak-hiah kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Klang en dowi matchang ang nowng uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Kung pra kowh laiklow sam tuak madiah, maru akawmma kowi en tüng en sangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">now kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi dow en peah kür reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Chownglawng kowi piakra uang ting miuüa dow en kowh laiklow hown ka sakkhawtra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">now kür uowi dowi miuüa paw en kowh laiklow hown ka kür reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Tawkche kawmat dow en matia luk kowi akrat pusara uang ting khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">naiawng rakowi en tuak krat khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:5">Akrat pusara dow pe en arau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">naiawng rakowi en sak nen khai.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Thurai kowi ringkawma hown en kram mih en sakowmra uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">En kowh tachi tanawmra dow en kowh sakowmra nadowi bow?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />“Kawmat sam tuak madiah, achinawmma mih maru piak mih uowi ne khowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Now aiungma mih maru-uüa piak mih uowi ne khowk bow?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Ang khi mih dow chang ngak miuüa chowtaih ka ripra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">now sawt angak liu miuüa chowtaih ngen angak rak reng.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Naiawng mih maru-uüa kowi dow kawli hown khowm Thurai nowng piakah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">now aia kowh kunmaraura hown amatni dow piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Maru ngakuüa dow krangsila iawng hek hai chang ran sulu reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">tawkche amatni kowi dow Thurai rimta hai klowkta pe iüng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Amatni dow aiüng uowi dowi mih krangsi iawng chakkham khawr hown kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">now amatni kowh chauüa paw krangsima kowh chauüa iawng taset plawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />“Ang tut-e dow kukpa satang uang ting lowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">nami satang dow ang param hown ang ta khai.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Ang müi su mih khin khe nami satang dow mang kowi uang tek ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">now nami laiklow ang ta hanow ang müi piak khai.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Nahanow kram lai bowt kowh ang chür klukluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">now ang kowh hut maten paw chürla kluk khai.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Ang pur hownia dow lümla powt lowk ia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">nahanow ang kowh pikchu dow rü hau khai.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Nami lümla dow ang pur kowi iowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">Tawkche aia powm dow ang tuk mat dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Now ririmma khe maiawng ang ta laiklow khai:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‘Maru mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi achinawmma nowng uowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Mia iawng mih maru paw Thurai pur kowi tachi tanawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Thurai dow mukuang kowi kowh aia naruüa kowi paw owmah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">now aia kowh kramamu-uüa kowi paw aia khi pe atawi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />Dinchow hown kowh aia thawpah mih maru dow plawng iawng aiachow piak reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">naiawng mih maru kowi tawng iawng chow aia naowmah kown?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Lusa maru dow rau-e singla now sat kup dowi rawn kowng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">amatni dow pamik klipchow hown chowngchowng saksakma vüi kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Amatni kowi dow tangbung lut iawng lutah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">now amatni dow chanlaira uowi dowi kowi kowng reng,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Elifaz plan tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:1">“Jawb, maru nauang khowng en kownkow atünma sam haw madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">kramamu-uüa nauang khowng en ne tak chünchü sam müah madiah sik.<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />“Kunmaraura dow sangching uowi dowi mih maru vüi kowng müa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">now irsira dow bualama mih maru vüi kowng müa chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Nawngchow vüi kowi bualama mih maru iuksown mih ang khi khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">Tawkchedow linlanma sang aia luk kowi uang chin pe piakra khai.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Aia kowh chauüa dow thaulangma ka uowi dowi bowt chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">tara chetra kowi amatni kowi takhula kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Aia kowh luprak dow sakkrai hown uowi miuüa nachata pe bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">aia kowh luprak chuh hown tavir lut towkala chepaw akhawr hown uowi miuüa nair pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">Tui sakkrai hown uowi miuüa dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan nair pe kown.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />“Angak chap mih krawng hownia uang lawt mih nadowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">now akrat pusara paw bawn hownia kowh awr ru mih nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Maih lün hanow maikhük mih aluk prakowi atungma pün reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">nami iawng uang dia hanow lusa maru mih akrat pusa hown atungma uowi reng.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />“Jawb, ang chowng en panü dow Thurai tut-e ang nalü khowng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">now ang kowh akrat pusara lawnguan mih aia kowi ang naphowk pe diah.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Aia dow abüp nowng khaiah dowi mowr mih kraingra lup chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">now awdara lup paw nowng rüaah dowi mowr aia chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Aia dow krawng luk kowi uang iu chin uangchak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">now üa hai laih luk kowi uang iu pe uang tui reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Aia dow maru krüa kowi uowi mih maru-uüa kowi maru luk kowi towah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">now uowila uiting uangtak miuüa kowi dow athaulangma aia towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Aia dow prengia ngak atekma miuüa kowh sangkrangra piakta pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh dow tawng lup paw chawn dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Aia dow chanlaima miuüa kowi thawp sangkrangra ngak khe khuowkah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">now kuanlama miuüa kowh kamrütra dow aia piakta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Amatni luk kowi dow ni-e aiiu uang kla reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">sat downg thüm khe uar-e kowh iawng sowp rutrut krawi mang büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Nachenganchepaw akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi dow kowngra hownia Thurai lawngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">now ngarai miuüa kowi dow akürma miuüa rut hownia aia lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Naiawng rakowi ngarai miuüa dow ka sakowmra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">now chet tara nowm dowi miuüa kowi dow Thurai kowpta pe nawr reng.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />“Thurai pring hawiah mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">Naiawng rakowi lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai pringhawi mih kowi nüah klowkah diah.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia krawi pe mih arau aia krawi iung reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">aia dow krawi pe ngarau reng, now aia rut hown krawi plan pe iungah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Aia dow aplan aplan phih hownia krawi lawng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">tawng iawng mih angak chap paw nauang ia kak en kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Khown kuak mih khin khe kowngra hownia aia nape plai en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">now tasen mih khin khe paw saidawng hownia aia natakhula en kown.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Maru nabek en angak kown mih hownia aia mih nahen en reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">Naiawng rakowi phih uang ting chepaw en nakram kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Piakra hai khown kuak mih khin khe en naren kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi paw en nakram kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />En kowh üa hai laih kowi mih mapaw hua nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">now kaurawng uaramchak hawmh paw nauang piak en kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />En kowh kim mih athaulangma pami en natuk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">now en ingsap dawngthawnguan khe tawngpaw tama mih nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />En kowh chauüa mih ahuma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">now en kowh krungchakuüa mih dowm kowi kowh pram iawng ahuma naown kown.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Luprak dow akua khin khe kuaah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">nami iawng dow ning huma singla kung kowi en naka tadupra kown.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Ang nowkah che maiawngün laiklow na nowm chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">naiawng rakowi sünta hanow en chownglawng kowi tawngah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Jawb plan tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Elifaz kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Ang kawm ang krat mih kaah akhai panü dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">ang ngare mih maten set kowi tangah panü dow,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />sata pang kowi kowh sema lak-e nalang di tak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ang kowh sangprowk laitek ingsap uowi dowi mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />“Leba sek hown lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG ap ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">nami leba sek kru mih ang buk kowi krawi taiau bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">Kramra uowima mih lup dow ang vüi ahuma Thurai towta hüah khai.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Nachaah kown mih pram ka dowi hanow kawrngaramchük pla reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">now nachaah kown mih chahau ka dowi hanow chia dow pu reng.<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Uadui lak chak akawma mih asowr uowi tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">asowr uowi dowi mih chakkham awisa hown nadowi matchang ia cha bow?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Naiawng mih chakkham dow ang paw ang nau dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">naiawng mih chakkham che cha hanow ang kow nga reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />“Ang awr lü awr leng mih CHAKRAMANG pe ang dit panü;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">ang nauah iawng Thurai uang chang ang dit panü iung diah.<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Thurai uang dita ang naknak kown mih ang nau;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">aia rut hown Thurai uang saita ang kown mih ang nau.<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Naiawng aia uang chang ang panü awmrawm kowh ang naprowk tak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">now mün khowt chow ang ngare khowk chepaw ang napiaw tak diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow chimsaima mih Thurai kowh ana pek katpaw üa dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />“Nasingla kown mih kür ang kowh uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Naiawng rakowi ang nasing kown mih sakowmra uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Ang kowh kow mih hua hown kowh thawpah mih nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">ang kowh buk paw kri hown kowh thawpah mih nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Ang matia natakhowngla kown mih kür ang kowh uowi dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">ang kowh uowi mih maten ang hownia rupta ang bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />“Tuak chur mih auiuauüa kowi dow nasanaah kown takla chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">tawkche en dow lang kri lang kraing mih kowi kram dowi kowi pe ang aprek khai.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Ang kowh auiuauüa luk kowi dow kaah sakowm dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">amatni dow tui tatat mih awchawng iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Awchawng dow nangkhe hown tathia mawp reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">now nangkhe hown tamum klum reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Nachenganchepaw satma khin khe dow tui kang bowk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">now krawi cham reng chepaw krum tui dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Naiawngün awchawng kowi krawi cham tui miuüa dow tamata tiama reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">now krum tui dowi kowh krawi mang panglang rakowi kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Tema prenchak hai Seba prenchak kun chang miuüa dow krawi cham tui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">amatni dow nakowi kowting hanow saktuak chur reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Amatni dow naka tui kown mih sakowmma hown krawi cham tui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">Tawkchedow tawng re-e paw krum tui dowi rakowi sak nga büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Naiawngün kangkhawngma mih awchawng iawng en paw khowng ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">khowng ang lak dow ang kowh akrat pusara khita hanow kram kowh kung pra en süt khai.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />“Aiawng hown pe ang uanh kown mih ang tek en bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">Pe ang awmrawm sung kown mih ang tek en khai bow?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Ransu rut hownia nalawng ang kown mih ang tek en bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">Maru ngakuüa rut hownia naklan ang kown mih ang tek en khai bow?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Ang kowh atawi ama uowi mih tüng ang madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">en che nowng tüng ang hanow rarimma ang nauowi kown taih.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Lainowm dow maru sak kowi nowng pe arau reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Tawkchedow en kowh nang dow asung uowi dowi.<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Ang kowh laiklow kowi khüm ang atawi kown en nau mih bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">En dow tuak chur mih maru kowh laiklow li iawng en nüla khai.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />En dow <char style="w">saratchow</char> chah kowi cham towah nar kownkow kuak plang chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">now en kowh auiua kowi khowm padow nasumta chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Nachenganchepaw sakrauma hown kawmat dow ang prakowi uaidang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">en pur kowi mapaw ang natek dai lai kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Plan tuakah iawk diah, now anowm nadowi mih aprek hauang pe ang tham bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">tawngplawng kowchow panow kawmat paw ang kowh angak uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Ang tek dai lai pabow en ka tuak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Aiung angak ang tuk dowi pabow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Elifaz kowi Jawb plan tek pe mih, “Lusa kowi dow maru mih kawmkrat hown lup chang takla reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">aia kowh chownglawng dow sukkri kowi mih maru iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Nar lup chang mih maru dow naka tanai kownkow chawng sat kup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">sukkri kowi mih maru paw ka sukkri kha kownkow hawt chawng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Nami iawng ang dow la towng tawi chawng chepaw iungra uang ting dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ang dow iak towng akrat kangowh chowtaih ang ka reng.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Müi mih khin khe paw tawng khe chow ang narü kown padow ang ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">now tawng khe chow uar nakowi kown padow ang tatuak khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:4">Naiawng rakowi uar thowi dowi mowr mapra lai paipra lai ang tarua kunlun khai.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Ang kowh kow kowi dow ma hai dung kangowh towbowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">now ang kowh pik dow cheng kowh mangchar tui vüng prukruk towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Ang kowh chownglawng ün dow pawngpai sowr lak-e kowi lang len khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">now naiawngün dow sakowmra uowi dowi kowi chur khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi Jawb chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Jawb plan tek mih, “Aw Thurai, ang kowh chownglawng dow kawli krowngchow towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">ang dow chownglawng kowi aiung nakhi kown nadowi bowt pami ka tuakah reng diah.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Kawmat dow en khi ang reng tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">Tawkche en nalüa khi ang kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:8">En dow nakrawi cham ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">Tawkche ang nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Mukuang kowi kowh uangnim dow tama reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">nami iawng maru mih kowng hanow uang plan dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Aia dow aia kim kowi nauang plan kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">now aia kowh kuachakuüa paw aia kowi natuk matah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />“Naiawng rakowi rarimma ang nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ang sak kowi rau mih laiklow ang natek bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">now mapaw sak-ih dowi mih laiklow ang naphuang bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow achawng mih krüa kowi en tuk tow ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">Ang sata kowi kowh dowkamang chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Ang kowh phangbek kowi thaulangma ang nauowi bowt kown padow ang ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">now ang kowh kawmkrat paw müita pe hanow na-e kown padow ang ka tuak khai.<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe mang lak kowi en krawk ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">mukmang hown dow lainowmma en pe kram ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Naiawng rakowi mami hut kangowh mih kow hown sing uowi mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">uang betta ang hanow kowngta ang mih chowbowt ang lang nau.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Ang kowh chownglawng ang sui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">chowngchowng saksakma nasing kown mih ang nau dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:16">Ang lowk iachow kowi pe uowi ang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">ang kowh chownglawng dow tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />“Tawngplawng kowchow en tut-e maru khowt pat asung uowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">Tawngplawng kowchow aia luk kowi khowt pat en pe ching khai?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Aia kowi dow rau towng en krawi müah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">now aia kowi dow atungma en chaingah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Ang hownia en cham dang dowi bowt tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">Now naiawn kria kown mih khin khowm en pe ang dowi bowt tham bow?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Aw thawngrum chawng mih, ang chang angak mih hown tawng chow en tawi own?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh leba sek manra en tuk changla ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ang mih en kowh kurdik chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh aprek hai angak en lawtta ang dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow kuam lak kowi ang nalüa uowi kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Nami khin khe en nakrawi cham ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Tawkche ang dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bildad rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Nakhowk khe Suhite chenchap Bildad tek pe Jawb mih,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Mün khowt tak chow naiawng mih laiklow en natek kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Mün ni tak chow asung uowi dowi mih laiklow en natek kown?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Lup iung chang mih kowi Thurai kingküaah khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Na mih kowi nadowi iawng lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai changah reng bow?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />En kowh chauüa mih aia kowi kingküala mih lup chang ngengche chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">Naiawng rakowi amatni kak taing mih ripra amatni kowi aia peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai tut-e en che lü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">lang kri lang kraing mih tut-e en che awr nguk awr kar khai,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />now chinawmma hai maru iungma che en na khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">aia mih kawmat paw en tek iawng nachang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">now asowrma mih kimchak kowi natow en iawk kown.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Nahanow en chownglawng kowi mih lainowmma lup nachawn kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">nakhowk khe dow en rik sunta mih khin kawmat kowh lak-e ngah en nanüla kown.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />“Achük alai kowh maru-uüa tut-e krawi lünta madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">amatni kowh pipu-uüa tawng chow sangla mih krawi paw satang madiah.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Anging dow mani maiak kowh chah taih, tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">lusa kowi anging kowh chownglawng dow nim iawng alenma powt khai.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Naiawng rakowi achük alai kowh maru-uüa hownia tasang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">amatni dow amatni tukah mih maten natek en kown taih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:10">now en naka prengia iung kown taih.<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />“Tui sik kleplep mih krawng kowi nadowi now uaklung ru dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">now ka tui dowi matchang uaklung dow nowng iuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Ka tui dowi now naiawng mih pram dow tarowng iuk reng tak khe kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">now akeng mih pram chap maten lak-e akeu lang len reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Thurai kowi tamata mih maru dow naiawng mih pram iawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ringkaw Thurai dowi mih maru kowh sakowmra dow naiawng napiak kown.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Aia cham sakowmah mih dow akhawtma nadowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">aia sakowmah mih dow lingleng bai iawng anümchow mih kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Aia che nami luk kowi tane hanow nami dow tapiak reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">aia che nami kowi tadawi hanow nami dow kham dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Sat atarma mih rah kowi kowh pram dow chimprowngchow uowi reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">maru ngak dow naiawng mih pram ru iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Naiawng mih pram dow hua chun kowi krawi sawt prün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">now huaklu luk kowi thaulangma hown krawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Tawkchedow nami hownia chawita kung kowi alawi khowm ta uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">Naiawng rakowi nami re-e amatni uowi mih miapaw ta tukah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Nami re-e uowi khe amatni kowh chownglawng dow chur khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">now amatni kung kowi dow nami arah kowi akeng mih pram uang ta ru reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />“Nachenganchepaw kaah sakowmma mih maru kowi dow tawng khe paw Thurai nuata dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">now chang lup ngak miuüa kowi katpaw Thurai khowngah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Kawmat paw en kowh nawr mih ren chele aia nachang en iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">now en sak kowi mih piawra atekma aia nachang en kown;<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />tawkche sui en miuüa dow narukrai bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">now maru ngakuüa dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Bildad kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Nami kung kowi Bildad kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Naiawngün en tekah mih laiklow maten dow aching pami ang tuk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Tawkche Thurai mik kowi dow maru mih achinawmma nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Thurai hown dow amiapaw nowng taüa dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">aia kowi 1,000 kat Thurai lünta e anawrchow khowm aia ia klang dowi tham.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow prengiama hai akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">aia kowi kingküa mih maru dow amiapaw nowng plai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Maru mingmang dowi khe aia dow hungma mawngma kowi sütah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">naiawngün hungma mawngma kowi dow aia kowh kunmaraura hown aia piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Aia dow lusa mih nachüah kownkow uang chin pe lihowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">now lusa chüng ün pat aia dow chüah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Sat kowi aia peah ana dowi now sat mih uang lawt dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">now krek ün kowi aia pe nowiah dowi now krek ün uang nowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Mukuang thawp miia dow aia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">now sata tuilowng luk kowi mang mih paw aia chowtaih.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Aia dow tawngphak pra kowh krek ün thawp mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">aia dow kuang dawnglang kowi kowh krek ün thawp mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">now mrawkphak pra kowh krek ün thawp mih paw aia chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Aia dow maru tukah dowi pat mih kri kraingma mih lup ün chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">aia changah mih awdara lup ün dow nowng rüaah dowi mowr chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Thurai dow ang pur iawng uang mang reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">Tawkche aia kowi dow ang khi-ah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:11">Aia dow ang ria iawng uang mang reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">Tawkche aia kowi dow ang tuk matah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Aia nau mih uanh aia paw khai e dow aia kowi amia chow nowng hangah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">‘Tawng chow en chang,’ padow aia kowi amia chow nowng tek pe kown?<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />“Thurai dow aia kowh kunmaraura mih taingah naklak dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">aia kunmarau khe sata nammow Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sata nammow Rahab </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow sata kowi kowh aiukma mih asak uowi mih chap iawng hai maru ka tuak ne chekhai. Tawkche Hebrai lai hown kowh arui uowi mih dow chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> kowh khowng miuüa khowm kram kowh chür reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Nami kowi tawng iawng chow aia kowi ang naklangah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Aia kowi naklangla kown mih laiklow tawng kowi chow ang cham ka kown?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Kowmatia kowi achinawmma pahai ang tatuak chepaw aia kowi ang nowng klang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ang kowh tara chet mih tut-e dow nasaksing sanala ang kown mih towbowt ang nowng lü.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Ang hawah mih khin khe aia klang ang khai chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">ang laiklow aia nasünta ang kown mih ang owm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow liku uangchak hown piak ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">now aiawnglowma plan plan aia dow pe ang ngarau khai.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Aia dow pe hü ang sak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">pe hü ang sak lak dow akrat kangowh tow ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Mami che kür lawnguan chekhai hanow aia dow akürma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">now tara chet lawnguan chekhai hanow tara chetra kowi aia kowi mia chow napawla kown?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />“Ang achinawmma chepaw ang kowh nawr mih nabek ang angak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ang aiungma chepaw ang kowh nawr natek ang angak kown.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Ang achinawmma chepaw tawng chow mrawkra uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">Ang kowh chownglawng dow ang sui chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Ang tuak kowi dow Thurai tut-e achinawmma mih maru hai angakma mih maru katsang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">Naiawng rakowi ang tek mih, ‘Achinawmma mih maru hai angakma mih maru kowi Thurai piakah reng,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Kramra uowima mih rawka hown achinawmma mih maru kowng khe Thurai dow ren reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Aia dow nakruitown lusa kown mih maru ngakuüa kowi peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">now tara chet miuüa kowh mik dow aduma Thurai chang pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Naiawng chang mih aia nadowi now naiawng chang mih amia chow?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />“Ang kowh chownglawng dow iowm mih maru lak-e chur lang len khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">nami chownglawng dow khila iungra dowi kowi chur khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Ang kowh chownglawng dow lawng sanh mih iawng alenma kowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">Nami dow uamu khüm chak khe kowh iawng alenma kowi khai.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Ang kowh kawm kratra ang natamata kown pahai ang tek chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">krat pusara ang kuakta hanow ang naren bowt kown pahai ang tek chepaw,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />ang kowh ngarera maten kowi dow ang kram reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang achinawmma pahai en nadowk ang dowi kown mih ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Ang kowi dow Thurai mih tang ang aprek khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">naiawng now ang kowh aprek uowi mih natüng kown tawngpaw mrawk dowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Ang che kowmatia kowi dua hown tasau chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ari powtla mih chap hown ang sia rut chepaw,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />en dow suplawk dawng kowi nakuak ang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">nahanow ang kowh tawnguat dow nasui ang kown.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />“Thurai che ang iawng mih maru chekhai panü aia kowi ang ia klang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">now angching kowh tara naia kala kownkow tara chetra kowi angching kowia kowi diah.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Thurai angching takra kowi ria mang mih maru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ria mang mih maru </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow maru pre ia tanga mih kowi kowh tawi thawp taking tasangra mih maru chekhai. </char></note> uowi lowk ia dit panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">nauang chet angching tara kown mih maru uowi lowk ia dit panü,<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />ang luk kowi kowh Thurai kowh ripra aia nahenta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">now Thurai kowh ripra ang nakram kown nadowi bowt diah.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Nahanow kram dowi kowi aia kowi ang naklangah bowt diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">Tawkche ang matia dow naiawng ang nowng chang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e Jawb lü mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Jawb plan tek pe mih, “Ang kowh chownglawng kowi ang sui khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">naiawng rakowi ang kowh kawmkrat laiklow aprawngma ang natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">now ang sakdawng kowi kowh laiklow Thurai kowi ang natek pe kown.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Aw Thurai, hauang tang ang angak diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ang kowh angak phai tüng ang rowt diah.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />En towk ang ngare mih tawng chow mrawkra uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">En thawpah mih uanh kowi dow khawk daw kowi en towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">now maru ngakuüa kowi en khowngah mih taka khai bow?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />En kowh mik lusa maru mik iawng chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Lusa maru khi iawng bow en paw khi?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Lusa maru chownglawng khowt chowtaih bow en kowh chownglawng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">En kowh chownglawng paw atownchow chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh angak en krawi cham ang rengreng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh atawi ama en dowk ang rengreng?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Ang kowh aprek uowi dowi mih dow en tuk towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">now en rut hownia miapaw nowng lawng ang dowi mih paw en tuk towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />“En matia rut hown en thawp ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">kawmat dow en piakta ang kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Bawn hown kowh en thawp ang mih sam tuak madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">kawmat bawn kowi en nape plan ang iawk kown mih bow?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Nathawpla ang kown mih kür apa kowi en peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">now au mu lak kowi ang kowh buk kow mih en thawp ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Ang kowh hut maten dow klikle kowi en tawm ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">now naiawngün dow nga hai pik hown en bawm ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />En pe ang singra hai en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">en mingkhet ang hanow buk iung kow iungma en tow ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Tawkche en sakdawng kowi en kamrütta hüah mih uowi lowk tak chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">nami dow en natowk ang ngare kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Ang chang ngak tak chünchü pami khi kownkow en tang mü ang mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">nahanow en narip ang kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Ang che changta angak khai hanow ang luk kowi ripra nauang ting ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Ang chang angak dowi chepaw ang nowng rowng lu dowi bowt chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">tawngplawng kowchow panow rukrai hai ngare hown atekma ang uowi khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Ang che rowng lu hanow krangsi iawng en nachawm ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">now kramra uowima mih kür en natüng ang iawk kown chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Nakingküala ang kownkow aplan aplan en naiowng ang saksi sar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">now ang luk kowi kowh sak-hiara mih en nape huah ngamlam kown chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">nauang sen ang kownkow aplan aplan en nauang pawla siphai sar kown chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />“Tawngplawng kowchow au mu lak hownia en uang tuk lawtla ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Miapaw khi ang dowi rawn tawngplawng kowchow ang kowng prang dowi?<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Ang uang tawi dia dowi panü lang iung kown chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">nadowi now uang dia hown krowksang cham dupta ang prang panü.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Ang kowh chownglawng atownchow mih khowk kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">kawmat dow ang nowng piawla nawngchow kownkow lawtta ang bowt.<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Iiu chamang iiu mih pren kowi ang lüa mang kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">tawng khe paw ang nauang plan kown nadowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />Nami pren dow iiu chamang iiu mih pren chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">nakowi dow sat downg khe kowh nowi paw uar dawng khe kowh iiu iawng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Zofar rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Nakhowk khe Naman chenchap Zofar tek pe Jawb mih,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Naiawng khowt mih laiklow kowi miapaw klang en dowi tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Naiawng khowt en tek lai khai pache na nowm pami maru natuak en kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Naiawng asung uowi dowi mih laiklow ta hanow ririmma ang nauowi kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">En <char style="w">prawngren</char> maru now maru pe en rukrai dowi tham pabow?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />En kowh owmra aser auowk uowi dowi pami Thurai kowi en tek pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">now aia mik kowi achinawmma en uowi pami en ka tuak khai.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Thurai uang klang en pakat dit panü;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">aia kowh saktuak Thurai uang phuang en dit panü.<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />Chanlaira lawnguan kowi Thurai uang tek en dit panü;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">tawngplawng kowchow panow chanlaira dow achaing huma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Sünta, en kowh angak iawng Thurai rip en dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />“Thurai changah mih lup lawnguan kowi en nowng tuk dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">lang kri lang kraing mih kowh nowng changra hu krang en tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Naiawngün dow mukuang lak-e lowng mih en tuk tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Now makownguüa uowi rah lak-e büp mih en tuk tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Thurai kowh tukra dow khaiah panü nowng khaiah dowi mowr chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">nami dow mami lusa nui hownia paimi nui lak-e lang klang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">now sata lak-e paw lang phia chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />“Aia uangah now uang tow en thawng hai chet en tara chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">aia kowi nowng hang mih maru miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Thurai dow asung uowi dowi mih maru kowi tuk mat chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">aia dow amatni chang lup ngak mih prakowi pela ching reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Kaurawng kawrngaramchük dow nowng pen lusa maru dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">nami powm iawng bualama mih maru dow nowng chanlai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />“En kowh sak maiow hown aia tut-e tape diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">now chawk rut se aia tut-e lü khowng diah.<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />En kowh angak uowi mih maten kuakta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">now en kim kowi tawng iawng mih angak paw hangkow tow diah.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Nahanow rukraira uowi dowi kowi en naia rowng lu iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">now kramra uowi dowi kowi anikma en naia iowng iawk kown.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Nakhowk khe dow en ngare mih en natamata ngengche bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">en ngare mih dow nawngchow mih tui lawt iawng en natuakah kown.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />En kowh chownglawng dow sat downg khe kowh lak-e nanowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">now aiiu khowm padow rau-e kowh anowi iawng nanowi bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />En kowh sakowmra uowi rakowi en nasakkraing bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">now thaulangma hown en naka uowi hai en naka tanai bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />En müi chepaw en nakram kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">maru kawmma en tut-e nauang lü khowng bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa dow naka sakowmra kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">now amatni dow krawi cham lawngra chepaw naka kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">Amatni kowh sakowmra dow nakowng kown mih krowngchow towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Zofar kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Nakhowk khe Zofar kowi Jawb tek pe mih,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Enni towbowt lusa kowi lang chanlai pahai enni tanü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">enni kowng now chanlai mih maru uowi dowi bowt pahai enni ka tuak khai.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Tawkche ang paw enni khowt dow chanlai chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">enni lak-e dow ang lang smu dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">Enni tek ang mih laiklow dow miapaw tuk dowi mih uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Thurai kowi ang hawah hanow aia dow uang klang ang reng chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">nachenganchepaw ang auiuauüa mih changla ang rensi kau khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">Angak uowi dowi hai achinawmma chepaw ang chowng rensi kau khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Asowrma uowi miuüa dow krat miuüa kowi changla rensi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">amatni dow tim kown chowbowt miuüa kowi nawtah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Tawkche damrauüa kowh tangbung kowi dow takhüm taran klow uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">Thurai kowi towkah sak-hiah miuüa dow thaulangma uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">Amatni dow amatni kowh kür kowi chowtaih nüla thurai khai.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />“Kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi krawi lünta büah madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">amatni mih natüngsang enni kown taih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:7">Uakling uaber hawmh kowi paw krawi lünta büah madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">amatni paw natek enni kown taih.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Krawng luk kowi kowh uowi mih chap kowi krawi lünta büah madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">amatni mih natüngsang enni kown taih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:8">Sata kowi kowh uowi mih sawng dam kowi paw krawi lünta büah madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">amatni paw natek enni kown taih.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow tuk bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">Thurai rut hownia mami phih uang ting mih pami amatni dow tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow asak uowi mih chap maten kowi mingkhet mih dow Thurai chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">lusa maru maten kowh singra dow aia rut kowi chowtaih.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Chakkham sowr dow dai tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">nami iawng dow laiklow sowr paw param tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Lawngtanguüa tut-e ka chanlaira reng pahai enni tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">now chowngdawng hanow prengia lang chak pahai enni tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />“Tawkche chanlaira hai kürra dow Thurai tut-e chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">now prengia hai nowng changra paw aia tut-e chowtaih uowi.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Aia che piakta hanow nowng rawah dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">now aia towah thawng mih kowi dow miapaw nowng lawt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Uangchak kowi che aia pe uangah dowi hanow süng rüp reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">now uangchak kowi che ahuma aia pe uangah hanow lusa lim reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Kürra hai chanlaira dow Thurai kowh chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">maru iung hai maru ngak pre ia trui Thurai krüa kowi uowi mih chowtaih.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Aia dow pren kruitown miuüa kowh chanlaira pawta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">now tara chet miuüa kowi abualama aia changah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Aia dow manguüa kowi rupta pe tawnguat reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">now amatni kowi dow thawng kowi aia towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Aia dow uamowuüa kowi klüpta pe tawnguat reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">now akrama chang low miuüa kowi paw aia klata reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Kaah sakowm miuüa kowi aia dow kowpta pe nawr reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">now lawngtanguüa kowh chanlaira paw aia pawta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Aia dow maru iukuüa luk kowi uang pawla pe rukraira reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">now akürma mih maru-uüa kowi dow aia piakta pe kür reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Aia dow iiu dawng kowi kowh tapet mih kowi tüngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">now lang iiu nowm nowm mih arah kowi dow anowima aia changah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Aia dow chenchapuüa kowi pe prungah hanow kri kraingma changah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">now amatni kowi mih setta plawt hanow piak paw aia plan piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Aia dow lusa kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi bualama changah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">now amatni kowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi pe krawi lenah panglang reng.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Amatni dow iiu dawng kowi krawi mang kown kamrüt mih maru iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">amatni kowi dow apuama mih maru iawng aia changah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ang dow Thurai luk kowi naowmsak reng kown</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Nami kung kowi Jawb plan tek pe Zofar mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:1">“Maiawngün maten dow ang matia mik hown ang khi khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">now ang matia param hown ang ta hanow ang tukta khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Enni tukah mih ang paw tuk chow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">enni lak-e ang lang smu dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Tawkche lowra nowng chang mih Thurai hown taklang kown ang nau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ang ngare mih lawnguan kowi aia hown talawp kown ang nau.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Enni dow lainowm kowi dai lai hown phumah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">enni dow asung uowi dowi mih maru rawk mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Uh, enni che ririmma uowi panü dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">prengiama mih lup enni chang mih naown diah.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Kawmat mih ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ang natekah kown mih laiklow kowi pe ching büa diah.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Thurai vüi kowi enni tek lai ngak kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Aia vüi kowi enni tek dai lai kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Aia prakowi enni tawi tangi mih bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Thurai vüi kowi enni uang taüa mih bow?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Aia che chaing enni e dow enni naiung kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Maru kowi ia kuan iawng aia kowi paw enni ia kuan kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Enni che kukpa aia prakowi tawi tangi hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">aia dow nanang enni ngengche kown.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Aia kowh kri kraingra kowi enni kram dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Aia kowh kramra khi chepaw enni kram dowi tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Enni kowh prengia lai dow plawi iawng asung uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">enni tek ang mih laiklow ün dow suplawk nek iawng kaah tawng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />“Enni ririmma uowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">now ang kowi pe tek ang lai büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:13">Nami kung kowi dow ang luk kowi lowra iawng pacham uang phaw lah.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Ow, ang kowh chownglawng kowi ang nape klaah phih kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">ang kowh sak kowi kowh uowi mih maten ang natekta kown.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Thurai kowngta ang khai chepaw aia luk kowi ang naowmsak reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">now aia pur kowi dow ang lawnguan kowi ang natek laiklow kown.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ang kowh sak plaira dow nami chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru ngak dow Thurai pur kowi ia iowng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Ang kowh laiklow maten süntaah kaneu büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">ang tekah mih laiklow maten enni pacham ta lah.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Ang lawnguan kowi ang natekah kown mih laiklow kawmat ang kamrütta hüah khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">Naiawng rakowi ang dow achinawmma naown kown towbowt mih ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Ang chang ngak pami mia chow ia tek kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Nami che ia tek hanow laila dowi kowi ang nakowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawng iawng chow aia kowh angak uowi mih Jawb lünta mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20-21" />Jawb tek mih, “Aw Thurai, mami pre chap mih lup phai iu chang ang diah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20-21">ang luk kowi kowh en kowh ripra alakma kowi henta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20-21">now hauang tüng ang kramra tham bowt diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:20-21">Nahanow en pur kowi ang naia iowng kown towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 13:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />En haw ang mih khin khe ang naklang en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">nadowi now pe tek ang laiklow diah, now en klang ang diah.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Tawng angak chow ang chang mih uang tek ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">ang kowh aprek hai angak mih uang tüng ang diah.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Tawngplawng kowchow en cham dangta ang lumowr khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">Now tawngplawng kowchow en nüla ang ransu khai?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Li hown kowh rown mih singh ram iawng mih maru kowi en natüng pe kram kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Chapli iawng rown mih maru kowi en nasenah kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />“Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang lawnguan kowi kingküala mih laiklow en ruiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">now ang klanguüa khe kowh angak maten en plau ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Ang kowh khawk kowi dow en krua ang lawngha leng kuar khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ang cham mang cham katra kowi dow en krawi mü ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">now ang cham mangra tiama ün kowi paw en krawi chaing ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Ang dow asuma mih uanh iawng piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">dung kremta nak mih uanh iawng ang phaw khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Jawb plan tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:1">“Masiuüa hownia kowh uang dia mih maru dow chowng townchow taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">now nami chownglawng dow akrat pusara hown atekma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Lusa maru chownglawng dow pau awr thar hanow alenma kle mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">Nami dow nim iawng alenma tama hanow tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Nachenganchepaw aw Thurai, tawngplawng kowchow en tang mü ang rereng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Ang iawng kür uowi dowi mih maru kowi tara chetra kowi en napawla kown tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Asürlawkma mih maru kowi chimsaima nowng chang mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Naiawng nowng chang mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Anging kowh chownglawng ni dow en khowm bowkta khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">mün la chow anging nasing kown mih en tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">En khowm bowkta khowk mih dow nowng klowiah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Naiawng rakowi anging naka tanai kownkow anging malowkchow kowi tow anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">anging kowh khin townchow mih sukkri kowi iawng asowrma pe sun anging diah.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />“Singh kowh khowm padow sakowmra uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">singh dow kripta chepaw naplan tak iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">now nami hownia amia sar nauang uowi iawk kown.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Singh kowh dow aprün prim reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">now nami prün dow bawn dawng kowi kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />Tawkche nami prün dow ka tui hanow plan tak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">now singh pawi sar iawng amia plan prek reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Nachenganchepaw lusa maru dow kowng hanow chur reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">lusa maru dow sak that hanow uang plan sing dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11-12" />Lusa maru dow kanh hai awkang khe kowh iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11-12">lusa maru dow kowng hanow plan ru dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:11-12">Amatni dow mukuang tama dowi mowr narü kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11-12">amatni dow makowng müi hownia nathowr kown nadowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />“Aw Thurai, makownguüa uowi rah kowi cham pet ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">en kowh kunmarau prowng dowi mowr cham petta ang hüah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Mün khowt chow ang nacham uowi kown mih khin khowm ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">now en cham pet ang mih arah kowi ang uowi mih ka tuakah diah.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Lusa maru dow kowng hanow plan sing iawk dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Plan sing iawk kown mih che ang tuk panü dow ang nachawng phülü diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">kawmkratma ang uowi mih hownia en nauang lawng ang kown mih ang nachawng diah.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Nakhowk khe dow en haw ang hanow ang naklang en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">now ang kowi, en rut hown kowh en thawpah mih maru kowi en naawmrawmah bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Nakhowk khe dow ang mangah mih tiama maten en natang mü ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">Tawkchedow ang changta mih angak en narüa ang kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Nakhowk khe dow ang changta angak mih maten en nalawtta ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">nami angak dow en nakhi dowi bowt kownkow en nakhuta ang bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18-19" />“Nachenganchepaw hungh takhuek bünlün mih iawng hai uowi rah hownia huaklu süt rürü mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18-19">lusa maru kowh sakowmra mih en piakta pe reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:18-19">now tui hown huaklu tarawt mih iawng hai bawn kowi tui nawmla mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18-19">amatni kowh sakowmra dow en piakta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Lusa maru kowi dow atungma en nowngah hanow amatni dow chur reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">amatni kowi dow kowng khe en klowita pe apowm hanow en sata reng.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Amatni kowh chauüa ka ringkawra chepaw amatni dow tuk dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">amatni kowh chauüa ka rukraira chepaw amatni dow tuk dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Amatni dow amatni kowh arau towbowt tuk büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">now amatni matia vüi chowtaih uowila uiting uangtak büah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Elifaz plan tek pe mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Nami kung kowi Jawb kowi Teman chenchap Elifaz klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Chanlaima mih maru auan uowi dowi mih laiklow natek kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">Aia kowh laiklow li iawng tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Chanlaima mih maru auan uowi dowi mih laiklow hown nacham taüa kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">Asung uowi dowi mih laiklow aia tek naklak kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Tawkche en dow Thurai kowi khowm kram dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">now Thurai tut-e paw en awr lü awr leng dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Naiawng en tek mih dow en kowh ngak rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">now en kowh laiklow hown dow en pet angak khai.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />En kowh ngak dow ang nadowi tüng en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">en matia nawr hownia kowh laiklow chowtaih tüng en.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:6">En kowh ngak dow en kowh laiklow hown tukah bowk mih towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />“Lusa maru pungmadawng kowi uang rik dia mih en chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Hungma mawngma uowi dowi rawn uang rik dia mih en chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Thurai kowh sangkrangra laiklow en tawi ta khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Chanlaima mih maru en lowk ia towbowt pabow en ka tuak?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />En tukah mih kowi anging tukah dowi mih uowi ne bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Now en tuktaah mih kowi anging tukta dowi mih uowi ne bow?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Anging pungmadawng kowi lawngtang sam pau mih maru uowi lowk ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">aia dow en pa lak-e paw lang lawngtang chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Thurai kowh sakklamra laiklow anging tek en mih en sak-ih dowi tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">Nami laiklow dow asamchow hown anging tek en khowk nadowi bow?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />“Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh sak tiama ngak kowi pawla en rereng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">Tawngplawng kowchow mik rikma pat en tuk kunmarau khai?<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Nami dow Thurai kowi en kunmarauah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">naiawngün laiklow dow en nawr hownia kowh en lawtah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Lusa maru dow achinawmma nadowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">masiuüa mu lak hownia kowh uang dia mih dow achinawmma nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Thurai dow aia kowh kramamu-uüa kowi paw owmah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">aia mik kowi dow mukuang paw achinawmma nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />Naiawng now lusa maru ngam dow mapaw tachi tanawm kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa maru dow suiiai kaniaima mih ngak hai lup ngak chang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">amatni dow tui kham iawng angak mih hing changta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />“Naiawng rakowi ang natek en kown mih kowi hawt sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">ang khi-ah mih maten dow en kowi ang natek en kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />Nami laiklow dow amatni kowh pipu-uüa hownia kowh chanlai miuüa kaah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">chanlaima miuüa dow naiawngün laiklow mih ang kowi lawpta ang prowng khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Amatni kowi kowh peah mih pren kowi dow amatni klen kowi amiapaw tawi uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">Naiawng rakowi amia iawng mih prenlang maru paw amatni kowi peah prengia ngak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Maru ngak dow achowngma ngare kowi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">sak ngakma mih dow sing uowi sak uowi mowr nangare kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Aia dow takrow takraira klow mih nata reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">now athaulangma pahai aia naka tuak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:21">Nakhowk khe maru ngakuüa dow uangah now aia kowi nauang senah kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Aia dow kowngra hownia naia plai kown mih owm dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">now aia vüi dow saidawng hown nakowng kown mih khowmta khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Aia dow krawi mang panglang se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">‘Tawng kowi chow ang kowh chakkham?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">Aia dow khin ngak uang tawn rürü mih tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Aia dow tuak kratra hai ngarera kowi lainowmma kram khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">Nami dow kamrütma nauang senah kown mih mang kowi kram mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow chawkla rut se kingküa Thurai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">aia dow lowra nowng chang mih Thurai luk kowi chang bawri khai.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Aia dow bawrima hai laiüama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">aia dow kawngma dowkma nasen Thurai kownkow kowiowm khai.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />“Maru ngak dow kurengma chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">now aia kowh kow dow akauma chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Tawkche aia dow maru uowiah dowi mih apiaknama mih marow kowi nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">now maru napiakta kownkow khowm bowkta mih kim kowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kurengma nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">aia kowh dawngthawnguan ün anikma nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">now aia kowh nim khowm padow nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Aiiu hownia aia dow naia plai kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">maih hown kowh kam mih singh mia iawng aia naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">now aia dow Thurai kowh kawli hown narown kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Asung uowi dowi mih uanh luk kowi owmsak mih dow kowmatia kowi takuan mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia owmah sak mih kowi aia dow tawngpaw naka kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Aia dow akhin nadowi tak khe aia kowh ripra naka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">now singh mia prek dowi mih iawng aia dow naiuk nasown kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Aia dow auih a-aima khe kowh prua bunlun mih grep ruih iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">now auih phaw dowi rawn apau dowh prawn rawn mih kanrawn singh iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi miuüa kowh dow chauüa nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">
    <char style="w">bümsua</char> tangka hown thawpah mih kim üa dow maih nakamta pe kown.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Aia dow chang ngak kownkow sangkrang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">aia dow angak kowi penah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">now mu lak hownia limmara uang lawt reng,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Elifaz kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Nami kung kowi Elifaz kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />“Naiawng mih laiklow dow ahuma khowk ang ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">enni kowh sakklamra laiklow dow pe kratra mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Enni kowh asung uowi dowi mih laiklow katpaw chur dowi bowt tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Naiawng enni klang ang mih tawng chow enni own khai kowh chow?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Ang krat iawng enni krat panü enni tek ang iawng ang paw ia tek enni diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">enni kowi kingküala mih laiklow ahuma ang ia tek diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">now khi enni hanow ngüpla lu se ang naia chit enni diah.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow naiawng tek dowi kowi nape enni sakkhawtra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">now ang kowh sakklamra laiklow hown dow enni nathaulang diah.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />“Ang prow sang chepaw ang kowh arau e dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ririmma ang uowi chepaw nami arau rim dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Aw Thurai, en dow pawta ang kür bowk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">ang kowh kimchakuüa kowi paw en piakta ang bowk khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Ang kowh kow dow arawngchow en chang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ang dow pik hai hut klen kowi tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow nüla ang maru ngak khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Thurai mih lainowmma sen ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">now aia kowh kunmaraura hown sekta ang kow nak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">Aia dow khi ang hanow kunmarau ang kowh krit iüng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">now aia dow kingküa ang kownkow mik rikma mü ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Maru kawmuüa dow prawngren ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">amatni dow awm kowi phek ang hanow changla ang rensi küakau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">now nakingküa ang kownkow ahawmsang takua talawm büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Maru ngakuüa tut-e Thurai mih apta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">aia dow maru ngakuüa rut kowi kuakta ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />“Ang dow athaulangma uowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">Tawkche aia mih uang piakta ang nak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Aia dow dowk ang ngawngtung hanow theu ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">now aia kowh leba sek manra changla ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />Aia kowh leba ap miuüa dow rumta ang lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">amatni dow saksing sana ang dowi kowi kia taplawn pat ap ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">now ang kowh müt dow krawng kowi dowh khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Aia dow plan plan bawp ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">now tasen mih maru iawng sen ang kownkow ang prakowi uang iowm khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Naiawng rakowi ang dow kar hai nguk hown khup sala uan khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">ang kowh bawrira dow bawn kowi ang kuakta khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Kar lai bowt kowh ang kowh lumowr arikma towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">now ang kowh mik ueng paw anumma towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Nachenganchepaw amia kowi paw ang krawi chang nowng dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">now ang kowh Thurai chup mih achinawmma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />“Aw lusa, ang kowh vi mih hangkow phumta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ang kowh kar klow mih hangkow pacham rim lah.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Kawmat paw ang kowh saksi thuak mih mukuang kowi uowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">tawi tangila ang kowh natek lai kown mih dow mukuang kowi uowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Ang kowh auiuauüa dow prawngren ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">naiawng rakowi Thurai tut-e ang awr kar khai.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Tawngbak mih maru dow a-auiuauüa kowi tawi tangila reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">nami iawng tangila ang now ang vüi Thurai tut-e tek lai kown mih maru ang lakke.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh chownglawng dow chur rürü towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">nami kowngra hownia dow ang nauang plan kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Jawb plan tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:1">“Ang kowh sak piak khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ang kowh chowng mih nachur kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">now tadupra dow hawt chawng ang hüah towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Prawngren dawma miuüa dow umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">now amatni prawngren ang mih dow ang khi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />“Aw Thurai, ang kowh aprek uowi dowi mih en matia ngengche uang phuang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">en nadowi now nakhowng ang kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Amatni kowh saktuak mumta pe mih dow en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi mih hangkow pe awngah diah.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Amatni dow marat kown nau kowh tang ang aprek khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">Naiawng rakowi amatni chauüa kowh dow mik nadu kown.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />“Thurai dow maru tut-e changla ang rensi kau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">ang lumowr kowi maru thawk ang kria khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Ang kawm lai bowt kowh ang kowh mik paw iiu khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ang kowh kow mih arawngchow towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Maru iunguüa dow maiawng ang own mih khi hanow awda khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">amatni dow tachi tanawm dowi mih maru pahai tang ang aprek khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Achinawmma mih maru dow chang lup iung kown mih tuk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">now chang lup iung reng mih maru dow uang kür ngamlam reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Tawkche plan plan ang pur kowi enni bowkbowk uang iowng chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">enni pungmadawng kowi chanlai mih maru lowk ia paw ang nakhi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />“Ang kowh chownglawng dow chur khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">ang kowh kamrütra maten dow piak bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">now ang kowh sakowmra paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Ang kowh auiuauüa dow uar kowi ni pahai tekah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">now aiiu kowi dow anowi pahai tekah büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Ang che tadupra kuam kowi changla kim kown sakowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">ang che aiiu kowi towbowt changla mawk rah khai,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />ang che tadupra kuam kowi towbowt changla pa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">now dung kowi towbowt ang changla tuamow hai u khai;<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />nahanow ang kowh sakowmra tawng kowi chow uowi tak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Ang kowh sakowmra tachi kown mih enni khi ne bow?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Ang kowh sakowmra dow kuam kowi ang hown natawi tadup kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">nami sakowmra dow ang hown natawi chowng bawn bowk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Bildad plan tek pe mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Nakhowk khe Jawb kowi Suhite prenchak Bildad klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Jawb, tawng khe chow en kowh lai nachur kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Tuakah kaneu diah, now pe tek anging lai diah.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow asadua iawng en nüla anging khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">Tawngplawng kowchow bualama en tuk ka tuak anging khai?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />En matia kunmarau hown en tatowk kawm mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">en tüng kunmarau khai pache lusa natama kown chekhai pe bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">En kunmarau khai pache aia uowi rah hownia huaklu nasüt kown pe bow?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />“Maru ngak dow maibu mit mih iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">aia dow katpaw lün dowi mih maibu iawng naown kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Aia kowh tangbung dow aiiuma nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">aia kowh maibu dow nanowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Aia kowh dow kamrütra akhawtma chepaw napiak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">aia kowh kamrütra dow aia piak müa nachowng kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Aia kowi dow leng chak ia prakowi aia kowh khawk napawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">now aia kowh khawk dow leng chak ia kowi nakow chawp kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Aia kowh klingnik dow leng hown natasük kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">now leng mih aia kowi dow nasükta chen kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Aia vüi dow bawn hown taphum hüah mih leng chak ia uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">aia kowh tiama kowi dow leng chak ia uowi hüah chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Aia kowi dow kramra kangowh umta lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">nami dow aia cham kowi rah maten kowi tawi krawiah khai.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Aia kowi dow phih mih hawt chawngah hüah chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">nami dow aia tim hown krowksang napiakah kownkow kamrütma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Rawka mih aia kowh buk kowi nakrawi tasak bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">aia kowh pabuk pakowma dow nasu hanow nater bowk kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />“Aia kowi dow thaulangma uowila mih tangbung hownia nacham pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">now kramra uowima mih makowng mang tut-e aia kowi nacham pawla kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Maru ngakuüa kowh kim ün dow nakam kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">amatni kowh kimluk kowi dow uangchak iawng napawksi maih nauang kla kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Aia dow adak kowi kowh aprün keu bowk mih singh iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">now aluk kowi kowh amia prek kowng bowk mih singh iawng aia naown kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Aia kowi dow lusa maru-uüa miapaw naka tuakah kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">aia kowh ming dow miapaw nata ka tuak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Aia kowi dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi nacham saah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">aia kowi dow anowima mih pren hownia aiiuma mih pren kowi nacham towah kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Aia kowh dow chuprek chaprekuüa nata uowi kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">aia kowh dow nata powng dawngthawnguan kown mih nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Naiawng aia piak mih satang dow satlawt hai satkup pren maru pat nata kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">nami tata hanow amatni dow lainowmma natakrow hai nakram kown.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Maru ngakuüa kowh uowi rah dow naiawng naphaw ngengche kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">tuk Thurai dowi mih maru kowh piakra dow naiawng naown ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Bildad kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Nami kung kowi Bildad kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Mün khowt tak chow enni natowk ang saktuak krat kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">Mün khowt tak chow laiklow hown enni nakingküa ang kown?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Enni dow plan plan pe ang rukrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">rukrai uowi dowi mih maru iawng enni chang ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Ang che changta angak khai nowm hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">nami angak sung dow ang chowtaih naka kown.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Ang lak-e enni lang iung padow enni ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">maiawng ang piak mih dow ang ngak rakowi chekhai padow enni tuak khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Tawkche ang luk kowi chang angak mih dow Thurai chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">aia thangah mih leng kowi pe tasowk ang mih dow aia chowtaih pami tukah büa diah.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />‘Khowng ang diah,’ pahai ang hek chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">Nachenganchepaw miapaw uang klang ang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:7">Nachet ang tara nowm kownkow atünma ang kar chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">Nachenganchepaw miapaw chet ang tara nowm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Thurai dow ang kowh tiama kowi kawmta ang khah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">Naiawng rakowi ang nowng mang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:8">Aia dow ang kowh tiama aiiuma changta ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Aia dow ang kowh ringkawra mih pawta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">ang kowh ming iung nang iung mih aia pawta ang khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Aia dow ang piak dowi mowr lowra hownia pe ang arau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">ang kowh sakowmra dow singh bur iawng aia burta ang khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Aia kowh kunmaraura dow ang luk kowi lün pluplup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">now aia dow nüla ang aia kowh ransu khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Aia dow nauang sen ang kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi uang chinah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">amatni dow nauang sen ang kownkow thawp tap klawk müa dawngbowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">now ang kowh tangbung riaret kowi uang umta ang lut büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />“Aia dow ang kowh tainau-uüa kowi ang hownia langta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">tuk mat ang miuüa paw tuk mat ang dowi mih iawng chang ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Ang kowh tasin taken miuüa dow powtta ang bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">ang kowh auiua sinuüa paw tamata ang bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Ang kowh pinsüauüa hai narmauüa mih tukah dowi mih maru iawng chang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">amatni dow nüla ang prenlang maru khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Ang kowh nar kowi ang hawah chepaw aia dow klang ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">nakhowng ang kownkow ang hawah chepaw aia dow klang ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Ang kowh sak hü nam khowm ang kowh masi sui khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">now ang kowh tainau-uüa paw suiiai kaniaima nüla ang khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Asowmchow mih ngeuüa pat sui ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">natawi tek lai kownkow ang awr rü now amatni dow prawngren ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Ang auiua sinuüa paw sui ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">ang sakrauah mih maru-uüa paw kingküa ang khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Kawmat ang kowh dow hut hai pik klen kowi tawngpaw uowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">ang kowh dow asak krowngchow towbowt uowi.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Aw ang kowh auiuauüa, saksing sana ang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai kowh rut mih pe ang ngarau khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow Thurai iawng enni chang ang nowng khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Enni towk ang ngare chepaw enni sak-ih dowi tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />“Uh, ang kowh laiklow maten ruiah panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">naiawngün laiklow maten chabowih kowi arui uowi panü!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Now huapher kowi ün lawngha kawlawm hown chowngchowng saksakma vüi ruiah panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">now khe kawlawm hown chowngchowng saksakma vüi ruiah panü!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />“Ang kowh lawng miia dow sing uowi reng tak pami ang tuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">aia dow achur khe nauang lawng ang kownkow lusa kowi nauang kown.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Ang kowh buk kow piak bowk khowk chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">kowng dowi rawn Thurai kowi ang nakhila kown.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Thurai kowi dow ang matia ngengche nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ang kowh sak dow aia kowi nakhi kown mih lainowmma sakkrai chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />“Enni natek kown mih, ‘Nami dow aia kowh aprek rakowi chowtaih,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">Naiawng tek hanow enni mih chang ang nowng khai.<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Tawkche saidawng kowi enni matia nakram kown takla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Thurai kunmarau hanow saidawng hown pe ripra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">Nakhowk khe dow tara chet mih uowi lowk ia pami enni natuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Zofar plan tek pe mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Nakhowk khe Naman chenchap Zofar plan tek pe Jawb mih,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“En kowh laiklow kowi ang naklang en ngengche kown takla.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh laiklow mih lainowmma pusa ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Mapaw nü ang klowk ang dowi mih nang klow ang ta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">Naiawng rakowi naklang en ngengche kown mih lainowmma ang nau.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4-5" />“Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi miuüa kowh awmrawmra dow nawngchow chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4-5">nami dow achük alai hownia en tuk ngengche khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:4-5">Lusa kowi thawpta maru kung hownia bowt now maru ngakuüa dow lainowmma piaw khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4-5">nami piawpara dow kra dowi pami en tuk ngengche khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 20:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6-7" />Maru ngakuüa dow iuksownra mukuang kowi lu tawk prang chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6-7">amatni dow amatni kowh kih iawng achowngma vüi nahing piak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:6-7">Amatni kowi khi miuüa dow, ‘Tawng kowi chow cham powt khai?’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Amatni dow uarmang kowi kowh iawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">amatni kowi dow tawng kowi paw nakhi-ah kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:8">Amatni dow mukmang kowi kowh iawng natama kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Amatni kowi khi reng miuüa amatni kowi nakhi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">amatni kowh kimchakuüa paw amatni kowi nakhi-ah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow ngarai miuüa hownia nakrawi lü luh kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">tawngplawng kowchow panow ngarai miuüa hownia krawi kuah mih uanh dow amatni nakrawi ta plan sat ngengche kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Amatni dow klanguüa kür uowi thüm chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">amatni kowh hut mih nalüa tadup kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />“Angak chap dow amatni tut-e adingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">now nami dow amatni dai krüa kowi petah büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />Amatni dow lup ngak mih kuakta kown mapaw nau dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">Naiawng rakowi nami dow nawr kowi towah büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />Nachenganchepaw nami dow amatni mu lak kowi asurma kowphaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">now amatni mu lak kowi mih rua kru iawng phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Amatni iawnta mih dawngthawnguan maten dow nahükta büah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">nami dow amatni mu lak hownia Thurai mih nauaita pe plawt kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Amatni kowh dow amatni iawnah mih maten rua kru iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">now amatni dow rua chawtah mih maru kowng iawng nakowng kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Amatni kowh dow aw kowi kowh tui iawng kuai tui uowi chepaw naia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">now awchawng kowi kowh tui iawng iawn tui uowi chepaw naia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:17">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow naiawngün mih naka chala kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Amatni dow amatni kowh kawm rak maten nata towla hüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">dawngthawnguan hown napiawla kown mih khin amatni dow naka kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ngarai miuüa kowi changah nowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">now ngarai miuüa kim mih krawi khün büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Amatni kowh lawphara dow katpaw adu uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">Naiawng rakowi tawng chap paw nanowng lawng büah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Amatni dow khowk bowk dowi mowr chi cha chakkham reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh iungra khin dow anikma nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />“Amatni kowh dow dawngthawnguan ahuma uowi chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">Tawkchedow akrat pusara mih alenma amatni luk kowi nauang ting kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh mu natek kown chowbowt khe Thurai mih naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">amatni luk kowi dow lün pluplup mih kunmaraura uangchak iawng Thurai naiu hüng pe kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Lawngha hown kowh rutchün khawkleng hownia amatni powt chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">amatni kowi dow kri leba hown kowh leba sek nakrawi chukta plut kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Nami leba sek tawk pluplup mih dow amatni kowh müt kowi naplawnta pluk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">now nami leba sek dow amatni buk hownia amatni rut hown nahowkah büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Amatni luk kowi dow achaing achaing mih kramra nauang ting kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Amatni kowh uowi mih chap maten dow Thurai nauang piakta pe bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">amatni kowi dow Thurai uang chin pe maih hanow nakamta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">now amatni tangbung kowi kowh akeng miuüa kowi paw nakamla bowk kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Mukuang mih amatni kowh angak dow naphuangta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">now lusa dow amatni kowi kingküala mih saksi nathuak kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Tuikling mangma dow amatni kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten nanawmla pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">nami kim dow Thurai kunmarau mih ni khe asaima nasaula pe kown.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Maru ngakuüa vüi dow naiawng mih piakra Thurai kamrüt pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">naiawng mih piakra dow amatni kakbak Thurai khowm pe mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Zofar kowi Jawb plan klangah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Nakhowk khe Zofar kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Enni mih sak hown ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">enni pe ang sakklamra mih ang vüi nami chowtaih naown kown.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Ang tek lai mih khin khe kham büah nawngchow diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">ang ki tek lai kung kowi enni naia changla ang rensi küakau iawk kown taih.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Ang taüa mih dow Thurai hown taih; maru hown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Aia hown ang nataüala kown mih auan iungma uowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Ang prakowi tang mü hanow enni paw awda khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">naiawng rakowi enni kowh nawr khowm padow enni pumta prang.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Naiawngün laiklow tuakah hanow lainowmma ang kram khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">ang kram lai bowt kowh ang kowh kow khowm chür prang towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />“Maru ngakuüa dow tawngplawng kowchow lawngtang pat sing khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Tawngplawng kowchow amatni dow uang kür ngamlam khai?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa awr iuksown mih khila khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">now amatni kowh chu cheuüa kowi paw khila büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Amatni kowh kim dow kramra uowi dowi hai thaulangma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">amatni luk kowi dow katpaw Thurai ripra uang ting dowi.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Amatni kowh dow chiala krawi paw hau chepaw iawm dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">now amatni kowh chiama hawmh paw pawm now katpaw iut dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Amatni dow chauüa kowi ruapur hawmh iawng prang kowi cham chinah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">amatni kowh chauüa dow ruapur chah hawmh iawng plaila dowk se cham len reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Amatni dow sawkchow hai taraw tepla se tek meng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">now ta prui tün büah hanow piaw büah pabüah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Amatni dow lowra lup chang kowi chawn reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">now thaulangma hown kowng büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />“Nachenganchepaw Thurai kowi tek pe büah mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:14">‘Anging hownia alakma kowi cham powt prang;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">en tiama lawnguan kowi tuk kown anging nau dowi.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Nami lang kri lang kraing mih mia chekhai chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Tawngplawng kowchow aia kowh lai anging nachün kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Aia kowi chup hanow tawng chow anging kowh mrawkra uowi?’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Amatni dow amatni kowh lup chawn mih amatni kowh kür hown taih pahai tatuak reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">naiawng rakowi maru ngakuüa kowh prengia pek dow mapaw ang nauta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />“Nowm pakhe dow maibu mit iawng maru ngakuüa mit kakat mih uowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Amatni luk kowi phih uang ting kakat mih uowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Amatni luk kowi Thurai kunmarau kowh ripah kakat mih uowi bow?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Li hown chahau cham rown mih iawng amatni phaw mih uowi kakat bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">Now liku hown chapli cham rown iawng amatni phaw mih uowi kakat bow?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />“‘Chang ngak mih maru kowh ripra achauüa vüi Thurai krüm pe reng,’ padow enni tek reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Tawkche aia kowh tara chet natüngsangah kownkow chang ngak mih kowi dow Thurai pacham ripah lah.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Chang ngak mih maru-uüa dow amatni kowh angak sung pacham ka ripra lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">amatni dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh kunmaraura pacham kham lah.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow chowng chur now nakowng kown towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">kowng kung kowi dow amatni ta towla mih kimchak vüi tuak büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Thurai kowi nowng tüng nowng sang mih maru uowi ne bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">Thurai dow kramamu-uüa kowi khowm chet pe tara reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23-24" />“Tawngbak mih maru dow kowng pat buk iung kow iungma uowi mih uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23-24">now amatni dow awmrawmma hai athaulangma uowi khe kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Now tawngbak mih dow kowng pat katpaw tawi krumla aiung sia dowi mih uowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">amatni kowh chownglawng dow angak kangowh hown chur reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowng khe dow katsang taih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">amatni kowi dow dupta hanow dung cha pe nga bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />“Tawng chow enni tuak mih aiungma ang tuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">nakingküa ang kown enni tuak mih maten ang tuk.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Enni tek mih, ‘Kawmat dow maru iuk kowh kim tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">Nami maru ngak kowh tangbung tawng kowi chow cham kowi khai?’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29-30" />“Chownglawng kowi achap kawm uanla miuüa kowi enni lüntaah kakat tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29-30">Amatni dow natek kown mih, ‘Maru ngakuüa dow Thurai kunmaraura hownia plai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29-30">now phih hownia paw plai büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Maru ngakuüa kowi dow miapaw tüng pe atawi ama dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">amatni kowi dow amatni kowh lup sung peah mih miapaw uowi dowi.<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32-33" />Amatni kowi dow cham dupah khe maru kawmuüa uang kawtla reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32-33">amatni kung pra hai pur prakowi maru kawmuüa tawi mang iualua reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:32-33">Amatni kowi dow thia pe bawn khe khowm maru tüng pe ringkawra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32-33">now amatni kowh tadupra kuam kowi paw tow pe kangchawng mih reng chekhai,’ napa kown.<verse eid="JOB 21:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Naiawng rakowi enni kowh asung uowi dowi mih laiklow hown tawng iawng chow ang naka sakklamra kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Enni kowh laiklow dow daila klen kowi tawngpaw nadowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Elifaz plan tek pe mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Nakhowk khe Teman chenchap Elifaz plan tek pe Jawb mih,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Lusa maru dow Thurai marat müa tawngpaw nowng chang dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">chanlaima mih maru khowm padow Thurai marat müa nowng chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Achinawmma en uowi e dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai napiaw kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">En kowh aprek uowi dowi e dow aia kowh maratra nauowi kown chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Thurai nang en mih aia kowi en ringkawah mih rakowi pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">Tara chetra kowi aia pawla en mih naiawng rakowi chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Naiawng rakowi nadowi, naiawng aia chang en mih dow en kowh angak rakowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Nami dow en kowh angak hu lai bowt rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Aiawnglowma en tainau-uüa kowi en tut-e en pe pawngah uanh reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">now amatni kowi dow tengiow tengklaima en towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Kawm miuüa kowi en pe khamah tui dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">now sakkrai miuüa kowi paw en pe chaah chakkham dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Akürma miuüa kowh krowngchow taih krawng bawn uowi padow en ka tuak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">ringkawra uowima mih maru-uüa ngetchow taih nakowi uowi padow en tatuak khai.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Rut khawma hown mamaimowuüa kowi en lawtah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">now siring saratchowuüa kowh kakbak mih en rupta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Naiawng rakowi en tavir lut leng chak ia kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">linlanma sang phih uang ting hanow uang tüng en kramra khai.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />En tavir lut mün khowt chow iiu khai mih en khi dowi mowr chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">now tuikling mangma limla en prang chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />“Mukuang alowngma mih rah kowi Thurai uowi nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Krek ün mün khowt chow lowng mih sam mü madiah.<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Nachenganchepaw en tek mih, ‘Tawng chow Thurai tuk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Khowt iiu mih uangnim khung hownia tawng iawng chow Thurai nachet a-i tara kown?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Uangnim atatma mih aia kowi tungta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">Naiawng rakowi aia dow tawngpaw khi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">mukuang luk kowi aia dow krawi len panglang taih,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />“Maru ngakuüa dow tiama ngak kowi mang reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">en paw nami tiama prim kowi natawi mang reng kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Amatni dow akhin nadowi tak khe piak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">amatni kowi dow asaima pat tuikling mangma tui saula khai.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17-18" />Amatni kowh kim dow uanh iung atekma Thurai tow pe chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17-18">Tawkche amatni tek pe Thurai mih, ‘En cham lang powt prang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17-18">lang kri lang kraing mih tawng chow nowng chang anging kown?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:17-18">Naiawng rakowi ang dow maru ngakuüa hownia alakma ang uowi reng.<verse eid="JOB 22:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Maru ngakuüa piak mih khi hanow maru iunguüa dow awmrawm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">amatni kowi dow angak uowi dowi miuüa maiawng prawng renah reng:<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‘Anging kowh ransu-uüa piak khai nowm bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow maih kamta pe bowk khowk,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />“Jawb, en mih Thurai kowh laiklow chün now na taih bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">aia kowi mih hangkow tuakla ransu tham bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:21">Nahanow en naka iungra kown towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Aia nawr hownia kowh prengia iung laiklow chün diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">now aia kowh laiklow mih en sak lak kowi towah diah.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23-25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23-25" />En che lang kri lang kraing mih tut-e plan khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23-25">alai kowh iawng aia mih naplan tow en iawk kown taih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:23-25">En kowh tangbung hownia che angak sia en kuakta hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23-25">en kowh kuh klu ün dinchow kowi en kuakta khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23-25">Ofir hownia kowh anang uowima mih kuh aw kowi en kuakta hanow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:23-25">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai mih en kowh kuh nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23-25">now aia mih en vüi lang iung nowm nowm mih tai nachowng kown.<verse eid="JOB 22:23-25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Nakhowk khe dow lang kri lang kraing mih hown en napiaw bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">now Thurai kowi atungma en naowm bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Aia tut-e en awr lü awr leng hanow aia mih nasünta en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">now aia vüi en takhamta mih maten en nachang pe bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Sakdawng kowi kowh en tuakta mih maten en naia chang bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">now en kowh tiama luk kowi mih anowi nasawt bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Maru che akrat pusa kowi uowi hanow en natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">‘Amatni kowi khowngah diah,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:29">Nahanow Thurai mih amatni kowi nalawngah kown.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Thurai dow aprek uowi dowi mih maru-uüa kowi lawngah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">naiawng rakowi en che anama mih lup chang hanow aia mih nalawng en kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Elifaz kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Nakhowk khe Elifaz kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“Kawmat paw ang dow Thurai tut-e chawk lai reng tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow towk ang ngare reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Aia kowi naka cham kown mih arah che ang tuk panü;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">nami aia uowi rah kowi ang kownowng kowi diah.<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Now ang lawnguan dow aia kowi ang naia chia pe diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">nami klen kowi ang achinawmma pami lawnguan paw ang naia tek pe diah.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Nakhowk khe aia klang ang mih ang nasünta pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">now tawng chow aia tek ang mih paw ang natukta diah.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Thurai dow aia kowh kri kraingma mih kür hown nataüala ang kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Taüala ang dowi tham; aia dow ang laiklow nasünta ang kown taih.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Anowmma mih maru dow Thurai hown ia taüa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">naiawng rakowi ang aprek uowi dowi mih aia naia phuang ang kown.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />“Satlawt prakowi ang krawi cham chepaw aia kowi ang khi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">satkup prakowi ang krawi cham chepaw aia kowi ang khi dowi.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Tawngphak prakowi ang krawi cham chepaw aia kowi ang khi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">now mrawkphak prakowi ang krawi tang mü chepaw aia kowi ang khi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Nachenganchepaw tawng chow ang chang mih aia dow tuk bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">aia che chaing ang e achangma mih kuh iawng ang chimsaima pami aia nakhi ang kown chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Ang dow kaah sakowmma hai aia tiama kowi mang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">tiama ngak pra mang dowi kowi aia kowh tiama prakowi chowtaih ang mang reng.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Aia kowh ana pek hownia dow ang cham süt dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">aia kowh laiklow dow ang nauah mih chakkham lak-e ang lang towah sung khai.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Tawkche aia sangkrangta khowk mih kowi dow miapaw nowng hangah dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">aia chang kown nau mih dow aia mih changta reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Naiawng rakowi ang vüi khowm bowkta mih iawng aia dow nachang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ang luk kowi nachang kown mih sangkrangra aia tut-e ahuma tak chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Naiawng rakowi ang dow aia pur kowi lainowmma kram khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">naiawngün ang tuak hanow aia kowi lainowmma ang kram khai.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Thurai dow ang kowh sak mih anenma changta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow lainowmma tüng ang kramra khai.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Aiiu iawng mih ngakra dow uang pumta ang nawr khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">aiiu iawng mih ngakra mumta lumowr klum chepaw rarimma ang nauowi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Nami kung kowi Jawb plan tek pe Elifaz mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:1">“Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai tawngplawng kowchow maru ngakuüa kowi chet tara kown mih akhin khowmah dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Aia kowi kowh tuk miuüa tawngplawng kowchow nami akhin khi dowi?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Maru ngakuüa dow nakhün krawng bawn kownkow süng rihi mat müa sütta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">amatni dow maru kowh ruapur hawmh ün kula hanow akeng kowi cham thingah khai.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Amatni dow saratchowuüa kowh kawrngaramchük ün pawta pe reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">now amatni dow lowi rakowi apawng iawng mamaimowuüa kowh chiala paw pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Amatni dow ngarai miuüa kowi tiama hownia prütta reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">amatni rakowi pren kowi kowh ngaraima miuüa dow kram kowh cham tapet reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Ngarai miuüa dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh krawi cham chak mih kaurawng kawrngaramchük iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi khowm amatni kowh chauüa vüi krawi kram chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Amatni dow nachaah kownkow maru kowh dowm kowi ün krawi kua luprak takla reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">now amatni vüi dow maru ngakuüa kowh grep krum kowi kowh dowh mih grep uih krawi lüm büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Chungrau khin ün amatni dow tengiow tengklaima uar prowt uowi büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow tawnguat uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Hungma mawngma kowi uangchak uang khe amatni dow sik reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">now tatung tanimra uowi dowi rakowi singku huamang re-e cham tatung büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />“Maru ngakuüa dow saratchow ngeuüa kowi a-u downg lak hownia rupta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">now amatni tut-e kowh pawah mih lowi rakowi ngaraima miuüa kowh chauüa kowi dow pawngta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />“Ngarai miuüa kowh dow tawng iawng mih tawnguat paw uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">amatni dow tengiow tengklaima cham mang panglang reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:10">Amatni dow sakkraima hown maru kowh luprak cham tawi kua reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">amatni dow tawmpa sakkrai hown maru kowh cha cheng cham tawi kawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Ngaraima miuüa dow cham tawi küa kanrawn sau chepaw ka kham dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">now amatni dow cham tawi küa grep tui chepaw tui sakkrai hown uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Marow kowi dow kowng miuüa vüi maru kar mih klow taah reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">ka ngarau miuüa dow naka khowng kownkow hek reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">Tawkche Thurai dow amatni kowh kar klow kowi pe ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />“Maru ngakuüa dow anowi kowi sui reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">amatni dow anowi lawnguan kowi tuk dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">now nami tiama kowi paw mang kown nau büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Sai sak mih maru dow murpa awr rü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">aia dow ngaraima miuüa hai ngarema miuüa kowi krawi sai reng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:14">now iak-e khe dow kuk mih iawng aia krawi ku reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Chang iang miuüa dow chawng sat kup reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">amatni dow mumta lumowr hanow miapaw tuk mat ang dowi bowt pahai ka tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Maru ngakuüa dow uariiu khowk now maru kim kowi cham krawi ku reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">Tawkche ni-e khe dow naukhi anowi dowi rakowi cham tapet büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Aiiu dow amatni tut-e ni nowi iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">amatni dow kramra uowima mih aiiu kowi changla auiua khai.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Maru ngakuüa dow tui lawt khe kowh tui hawr len mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">amatni kowh uowi mih maten kowi dow Thurai kowh piati uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow grep krum kowi amiapaw kowkowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Aden hai sat kang hown dow nangkhe nowng ter reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">nami iawng dow kowngra paw maru ngakuüa kowi nowng mata reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Naiawng mih maru kowi dow a-u khowm tamata reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">amatni kowh kow dow dung hawmh chaah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Chang lup ngak miuüa kowi dow amiapaw sak kowi towah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">amatni dow singh taklowk mih iawng piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />“Amatni dow ka chah dowi mih masiuüa kowi changah nowng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">now mamaimowuüa kowi paw saksing sanaah büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow aia kowh kür hown akürma mih maru ngakuüa kowi piakah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">amatni dow akürma chepaw amatni kowh chownglawng mih anikma uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Maru ngakuüa kowi dow athaulangma aia pe uowiah chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">Tawkche tawng chow amatni chang mih dow aia tang müah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Maru ngakuüa dow nawngchow mih akhin kowi phaw reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">Tawkche amatni dow akeng mih maru maten iawng kowng reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">Amatni dow pram keu iawng keu reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">now chapüi iawng keu reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Ang tawi mih mia chow nowng tüng ang kown mih uowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">Ang tekah mih laiklow aching nadowi pahai amia chow nowng tek kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Bildad plan tek pe mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Nakhowk khe Suhite chenchap Bildad tek pe Jawb mih,<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Thurai dow lainowmma kür chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">aia kowi dow ringkawma hown nakramah bowk kown takla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:2">Aia dow mukuang kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi thaulangma towah khai.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Aia kowh mukuang siphai kawm krang dow nowng rüaah dowi mowr chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">aia kowh anowi dow bowkbowk luk kowi krawi sawt reng.<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />“Thurai tut-e lusa maru kowh angak uowi dowi mih nauowi kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Masiuüa hownia kowh uang dia mih maru achinawmma nauowi kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Thurai dow lama lak-e khowm lang kri kraing chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">now krek ün lak-e paw anowi lang tawk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Naiawng now tawng iawng chow lusa maru achinawmma naown kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">Lusa maru dow dungh iawng chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">lusa maru dow tiadüng klen kowi tawngpaw nadowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s">Bildad kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Bildad kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“En kowh laiklow dow kür uowi dowi mih kowi tawngpaw khowngah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">en kowh laiklow dow tawngpaw pe kür dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />En kowh prengia lai dow tawngpaw chanlaima thawp ang dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">en kowh laiklow kowi dow chanlaira hai tukra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Chanlaira lai natek kown mih mia chow sang enni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Amia nawr hownia kowh laiklow chow enni tek?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />“Kowng miuüa kowh lümla mih kram kowh lainowmma chür khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">amatni dow krawng dawng kowi kowh tui kowi chürla kluk khai.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Tawkche Thurai dow makowng pren mih tuk bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">makowng pren dow Thurai hownia nowngia tapet dowi.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Aia dow akuangma mih aluk prakowi mukuang mih towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">now akuangma mih adak prakowi dow lusa mih aia tarah khai.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Aia dow tui mih uangnim lak kowi nungta hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">Tawkche nami tui dik hown uangnim mih tathek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Aia dow la pre khe kowh lama kowi khuah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">nami lama luk kowi dow aia dau pe uangnim reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Aia dow sata luk kowi pren sünghi mih thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">nami rihi dow aiiu hai anowi takra kowi aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Mukuang chüng ün dow chü nurlur khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">now aia nangah hanow naiawngün dow kram kowh chürla nuk khai.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Aia dow aia kowh kür hown sata tui talowng phunglung mih rimta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">now aia kowh nowng changra hown Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rahab </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan tuk kown nau now Jawb 9:13 kowi kowh footnote mü diah. </char></note> kowi mih dungta naknak khai.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Aia kowh kawli hown mukuang dow achimma aia changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">now powt mih rua kowi dow aia rut hown aia saiah khai.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Naiawngün dow aia kowh lup lawnguan kowi ditchow taih tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">naiawngün dow aia kowh kür uang tüng ditchow mih taih tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">Thurai dow mün khowt chow kri kraing khai mih miapaw tuk dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowh achur laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Now Jawb plan tek pe Bildad mih,<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Chet ang tara nowm dowi mih masing Thurai ming hown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai ming hown ang takham khowk.<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />Ang sing uowi sak uowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">now Thurai pe ang mih kawli ang tut-e uowi mowr,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />ang kowh nawr mih natek angak lai kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">now ang kowh dai paw nakuan kown mih laiklow natek kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Enni kowh laiklow dow na nowm pami katpaw ang natek kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ang kowng dowi mowr dow ang kowh aprek uowi dowi pami ang natek reng kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Ang kowh angak uowi dowi pami dow ang natek reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ang sing uowi mowr dow ang kowh aprek uowi dowi mih ang natuak reng kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />“Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow maru ngakuüa iawng pacham ka ripra lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">kingküa ang miuüa dow chang lup ngak miuüa iawng pacham ka ripra lah.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Aia kowi ringkaw dowi miuüa kowi dow Thurai piakta reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">nakhowk khe amatni kowh dow tawng iawng mih sakowmra paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Amatni luk kowi dow akrat pusara uang ting reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">Nakhowk khe amatni kowh kar klow mih Thurai sünta pe kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Nakhowk khe lang kri lang kraing mih hown amatni napiaw kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Nakhowk khe atungma Thurai kowi haw büah tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />“Thurai nowng changra lawnguan kowi ang natüngsang enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">lang kri lang kraing mih lawnguan kowi tawngpaw ang naitah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Enni dow Thurai changah mih maten khi bowk khowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">naiawng e tawngplawng kowchow asung uowi dowi mih laiklow enni tek rengreng?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Maru ngakuüa kowi tawng chow Thurai nachangah kown mih ang natek enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">now amatni kowi tawng iawng chow Thurai naripah kown mih ang natek enni kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Nami dow amatni kowh chauüa akawmma chepaw tasenra kowi nakowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">now tawngbak mih dow chakkham khawr hown nakowng kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Nami kung kowi kowh ta sing mih ngeuüa dow makowng hawi hown nakowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">amatni vüi dow amatni kowh mamaimowuüa khowm nanguk nakar pe kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Maru ngakuüa dow dinchow iawng ahuma krüm tai chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">now klungchut iawng tahur prang krüm tawnguat büah chepaw<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />naiawngün tawnguat mih maru iunguüa chowtaih nata ka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">now amatni kowh tai dow angak uowi dowi miuüa chowtaih nata taret kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Amatni kowh kim dow lingleng bai iawng anümchow naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">now amatni kowh kim dow laih kowi kowh kangchawngra kim iawng rawkachow naown kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Amatni dow müi kownkow mawk khe kurengma chepaw naia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">Tawkche amatni awr thowr müi khe dow ngaraima naown büah kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Amatni tut-e dow tuikling mangma iawng kramra nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">now amatni kowi dow uar-e khe liku nacham rownla kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Amatni kowi dow satlawt li mih nacham rownla ving kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">now amatni dow amatni kowh uowi rah kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Amatni kowi dow sanaah dowi matchang li nauang hutah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">nakhowk khe amatni dow nami li kür hownia napowt kown mih nakrat kown.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi dow khareah se maru naphek pe rut kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">amatni kowi dow hiu sürlür se maru nakhareah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Chanlaira lawnguan kowi Jawb kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Jawb tek mih, “Kuh hai tai paw apawk rah uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">now naiawngün achangma nachangla kown mih arah paw uowi.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Lawngha dow krawng dawng hownia thaiah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">now hua chawrah mih hownia dow kri phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Asung khakma mih hua dow krawng dawng abüpma mih rah kowi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">naiawngün dow pawla pe atowr müa hanow aiiuma mih dawng kowi maru krawi cham reng.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Naiawngün dow katpaw maru tingah dowi mih arah kowi maru krawi chamah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">now abüpma pat thaiah hanow leng hown tatar kawlaw se chang lup büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />A-i ka luprak mih dow krawng luk hownia kowh uang ru mih hownia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">Tawkchedow nami krawng dak abüpma kowi maih hown bawn chawr reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Krawng dak kowi kowh hua lak kowi asung khakma mih hua uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">now bawn dawng kowi dow kuh uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Naiawngün asung khakma mih hua uowi rah dow <char style="w">langta</char> tuk dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">now mukaichow paw naiawngün uanh dow katpaw khi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Naiawngün uanh uowi rah kowi dow kaurawng uaramchak katpaw chawp dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">naiawng mih uanh uowi rah kowi dow krangsi paw katpaw krawi kowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Naiawng akhawtma mih hua kowi maru chowtaih krawi teu reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">naiawngün dow hungh tut kowi abüpma maru krawi thaiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Lusa maru dow hungh tut kowi abüpma krawi thai khawng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">now nakowi kowh uowi mih uanh asung khakma mih krawi khi reng.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Lusa maru dow mrawng kowi kowh tui kla sawmlawm mih krawi owngta reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">now nakowi tapet mih asung khakma mih uanh dow anowi kowi uang pawla büah reng.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />“Nachenganchepaw tawng kowi chow chanlaira dow naka kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Now prengia dow tawng kowi chow cham uowi?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Nami dow sing miuüa uowi rah kowi uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">now nami kowh asung paw miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Nami chanlaira dow sata kowi paw uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">now tui abüpma mih rah kowi paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Nami dow kuh achangma mih hown paw nowng ranah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">now tai ahuma hown paw nami sung nowng the dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Nami dow Ofir hownia kowh kuh hown paw nowng ran dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">now asung lang khak nowm nowm mih hua hown paw nowng ran dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Nami dow kuh hai asung khakma mih nimrua hown paw nowng tuah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">now kuh achangma mih bia hown paw nami dow nowng phaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Nami chanlaira tut-e dow asung khakma mih hua kowh paw asung uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">asung lang khak nowm nowm mih uanh lak-e paw nami dow asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Nami dow Ethiawpia pren kowi kowh asung lang uowi mih hua hown paw ia tuah dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">kuh achangma mih hown paw nami dow nowng ranah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />“Naiawng now tawng kowi chow chanlaira naka kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Now prengia dow tawng kowi chow cham uowi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Nami dow asak uowi mih chap maten kowh mik hownia tapet khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">now kuang dawng kowi kowh iow mih uakling hawmh tut-e paw apetma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Kowng khowk miuüa hai piak khowk miuüa paw nami lawnguan tala chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">Tawkche nami chanlaira tawng hownia chow ka kown mih nowng tek büah dowi.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />“Nami chanlaira uowi rah dow Thurai chowtaih tuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">aia chowtaih tawng kowi chow nami naka kown mih tuk.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow prenchur nammowt khi bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">aia dow mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih sia maten khi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Li kowi aia peah kür mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">mün khowt chow sata naiuk kown mih khowm bowkah mih khin khe,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />tawng khe chow uangchak nauang kown mih khowm bowk mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">now pla nowi hai kaikreng nasawr kown mih tiama khowm bowk mih khin khe<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />chanlaira kowi mih aia khi khai, now nowkah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">nami dow klangiungma aia müah khai, now pawah satang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Nami kung kowi dow lusa maru kowi aia tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‘CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow chanlaira chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">now angak hownia lang süt mih dow prengia chekhai,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s">Rik kaah mih prasi lawnguan kowi Jawb tek mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Nami kung kowi Jawb plan tek mih,<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Owh, Thurai mingkhet ang mih la ün ang plan ka panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">Thurai kruitown ang mih ni ün ang plan ka panü.<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Nami khin khe dow aia kowh maibu uang tüng ang tiama reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">now aia kowh anowi hown iiu dawng kowi ün ang cham mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Aiungma ang uowi mih khin khe dow Thurai mih uang tawi uowila ang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">aia dow ang kowh tangbung kowi uang tawi uowila ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Nami khin khe dow lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai ang tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">now ang kowh chauüa paw ang riaret kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Nakhowk khe dow ang kowh chiama hawmh mih lainowmma pe iawn tui chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">now ang vüi kowi hua kangowh mih krawng hownia paw kanrawn sau ahuma uang phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />“Marow tapplawt kowi kowh takua talawmra kowi dow ang kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">now nakowi dow ringkawra uowima mih chowm rah kowi ang kowchowm khai.<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />Nakhowk khe klanguüa hawmh dow khi ang hanow hen ang tiama reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">now lawngtang aluchowuüa paw iowng se ringkaw ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Maru iukuüa dow amatni talawp mih taingta reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">now ringkaw ang kowh ririmma uowi büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Nami klen kowi aluchowuüa paw ririmma uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">amatni klow rim krang paw krang kowi dai cham tadan khai iawng towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />“Ang laiklow sünta mih maten dow kiow ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">now ang kowh lup chang khi miuüa dow tek ang awmrawm lai reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Ngarai miuüa uang kar khe ang khowngah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">now akhowng mih uowi dowi mih saratchowuüa kowi ang lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Ang khowngah rakowi kowng kown chowbowt mih maru pat pela ang prasi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">mamaimowuüa sak kowi dow ang peah awmrawmra khai.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Achinawmma mih chownglawng dow tawnguat iawng ang khupah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">now tara nowm dow napawng iawng ang suiah khai.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Ang dow mik duma miuüa kowh tiama tüng mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">ang dow klowng khawn tabai miuüa kowh kruitown mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Ang dow ngarai miuüa kowh pa iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">ang tuk matah dowi miuüa kowi paw ang khowngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Maru ngakuüa kowh kürra dow ang piakta pe reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">amatni rut hownia dow maru-uüa kowi ang lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />“Ang ka tuak mih, ‘Ang kim kowi ang nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">ang kowh chownglawng ni dow sema iawng ahuma ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Ka tui reng mih singh prün iawng kow iungma ang nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">now uar prowt nang tui kla reng mih singh mia iawng chimprowngchow ang nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Maru kawmuüa tut-e dow ang kowh ringkawra nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">klanguüa khe kowh ang kowh kür dow asar iawng atungma nauowi reng kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />“Maru kawmuüa dow ang kowh laiklow nasünta kownkow hawt chawng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">amatni dow ang kowh prengia lai nasünta kownkow ririmma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Ang ki tek laiklow kung kowi amatni dow amiapaw talai dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ang kowh laiklow dow amatni sak kowi klangiungma kup khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Amatni dow maru chawng uang iawng ang kowh laiklow nasünta kownkow hawt chawng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">amatni dow siadawng kla dowi rawn khe kowh nau uang mih iawng ang kowh laiklow sünta kown nau büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Amatni saktuak krat mih khin khe ren nawr hown ang tang müah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">nahanow amatni dow ka sakkhawtra reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Amatni kowi dow ang tüng pe tiama reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">now aluchow iawng ang kruitownah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">Siphaiuüa kowi mang kruitownah iawng amatni kowi dow ang kruitownah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">now kar hai nguk hown uowi miuüa kowi dow ang depah reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowh ngarera lawnguan laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Jawb tek mih, “Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow ang lak-e kowh ning dia miuüa prawngren ang khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">amatni kowh pa kowi dow tawi chawng ang ruapur hawmh mih kui hown khowm towla kown ang sui chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Amatni kowh kür dow ang vüi tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">amatni kowh dow tawngpaw kür uowi dowi chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Akhawr hai sakkrai hown uowi rakowi amatni kowh powm khowm keureuchow chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">amatni dow uar-e khe ririm raramma mih dawng kowi cham ku cha singh prün kau prün reng mih taih diah.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Amatni dow ruih mung krüa kowi kowh asowr uowi dowi mih pramna taih chowdiah cham cha reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">amatni kowh chakkham dow singh prün ün taih chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Amatni kowi dow khi-ah hanow kua hai marow hownia maru prütah reng mih taih chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">amatni kowi dow kuk mih kowi iawng maru krawiah reng mih taih chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Amatni dow aw pang kowi kowh hua krüa kowi cham uowi mih maru taih chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">amatni dow puk lak kowi hai hungh cheng mih takra kowi cham uowi mih maru taih chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Pram mung hownia amatni dow kawrngaramchük iawng pla reng mih chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">now pram dawng kowi tachek taetma hown uowi mih maru taih chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Amatni dow asung uowi dowi mih hai ming ngak nang ngakma mih maru taih chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">amatni dow pren hownia maru prütta mih maru-uüa taih chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />“Kawmat dow amatni kowh chauüa mih tek meng se prawngren ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">amatni tut-e dow ang chowng prawngren müa khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Amatni dow sui ang kowh ang hownia alakma lang uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">ang lumowr kowi thawk ang kria kown khowm kram büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai mih kür khawma chang ang hanow towk ang kawm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">naiawng rakowi amatni dow kowmatia kowi nowng townah dowi prang kingküa ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Kunma denma mih klanguüa hawmh dow purdowng hownia uang sen ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">now ang apowt takla pat uang chang ang naklak büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">Amatni dow nauang senla ang kownkow tap pün müa thawp chut büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Amatni dow ang naia powtla dowi kownkow pitta ang tiama khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">amatni dow miapaw akhowng takla dowi kowi piak ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Amatni dow tap takra auarma mih hownia siphai hawmh iawng uang sen ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">now ang luk kowi uang tachun nawilawi uang thua ang büah khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Kramra chap maiow ang luk kowi uang tamum klum khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ang kowh ringkawra mih li iawng cham rownla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">now ang kowh iungra maten dow uangnim iawng tama khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />“Kawmat dow ang nalüa kowng kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">akrat pusara dow ang kowh chownglawng kowi hing uowi hüah chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Uar-e khe ang kowh hut kowi lainowmma rau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">uar prowt chi nami arau dow hing uowi hüah chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />“Aia kowh rut akürma mih hown Thurai mih dowk ang kowrmow khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">Aia dow dowk ang kowrmow ngawngbam hanow küng ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih suplawk dawng kowi kuakta hüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">now ang dow dinchow hai plawi iawng ang own khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />“Aw Thurai, en tut-e ang uang kar khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">Tawkchedow en uang klang ang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">En pur kowi ang uang iowng dawnglawng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">Tawkchedow mü khowm en mü ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Ang kowi mih angak rawnma en chang ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">en kowh akürma mih bawng hown en chang ang nowng khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />En krowngla ang hanow li kowi en lawtta ang hüah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">liku uangchak kowi en kuak ang hanow en pe plai ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Kowngra prakowi en pawla ang mih pami ang tuk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">maru maten kowh chur rah kowi en pawla ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi Hebrai lai hown arui uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note> “Tatheu mih hai kar se lü khowng miuüa kowi maru khowngah reng nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">Naiawng mih maru kowi maru peah arau kakat tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Akawm akrat hown uowi miuüa vüi ang kar dowi pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Now ngarawng ngarai miuüa rakowi ang sak kowi rau dowi pabow?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Nachenganchepaw aiung nauang ting kown mih ang sakowm khe angak uang ting khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">now anowi nauang sawt kown mih ang sakowm khe aiiu uang kla khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Ang kowh sak lak kowi akrat pusara mih katpaw rim dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">ni towng ang sak kowi arau uang ting rakowi ang arau uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Ang dow uangnim aiiuma mih ni iawng lumowr klimma ang uowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">naiawng rakowi takua talawmra kowi ang iowng hanow ang tawi lü khowng khai.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Ang dow brenkhui hai <char style="w">ut uakling</char> auiua cham chowng khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Ang kowh pik dow anumma phaw khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">krau hown ang kowh pik den krang kam kown iawng towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Kawmat dow taprüa taiia khe kowh taraw tün towbowt ang tep reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">now ang kowh prui hownia dow uowila uiting uangtak khe kowh meng owi towbowt lawt reng,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="s">Aprek uowi dowi mih lawnguan Jawb tek mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />“Ang kowh mik hown ang tatow sangbowk laitawm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">Naiawng rakowi ir mih saktuak hown malauüa prakowi ang namü kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Lusa maru vüi tawng chow Thurai chang?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Mukuang kowi kowh lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai tawng chow pe?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Nami dow maru ngakuüa vüi piakra chowtaih nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">Now lup ngak chang miuüa vüi phih chowtaih nadowi bow?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Thurai dow tawng chow ang chang mih khi bowk nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">now ang kowh khawk san maten paw aia khi bowk nadowi bow?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />“Ang dow mia kowi paw cham krawi daila dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">ang dow mia kowi paw cham krawi kuanla dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Thurai dow achima mih set khai iawng pacham khai ang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">nahanow aia dow ang achinawmma pami natuk kown towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Ang kowh khawk che tiama ngak kowi cham mangla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ang kowh sak che ang kowh mik khi-ah mih kowi cham krawi irla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">nadowi now ang kowh rut che akeng mih angak hown tasür talawkla khai hanow,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />ang changah mih luprak dow maru pacham chata lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">now ang changah mih luprak mih maru pacham piakta lah.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />“Ang kowh sak che masiuüa prakowi cham tuakla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">now chang iang kownkow kimping namkhetuüa kimplawt re-e ang cham chawng khai hanow,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />ang kowh masi mih akeng mih maru kowh narma pacham chowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">now akeng mih maru-uüa mih aia hown pacham taphua taiua lah.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Masiuüa irra dow ang vüi kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">Nami dow tara chet miuüa hownia nakala ripra kown mih lup ngak chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Nami ngak dow asaima nowngia piak mih maih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ang kowh uowi mih maten nami angak mih maih iawng nowngia kam chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />“Ang kowh narma narlauüa uang chawk lai mih khin uowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">nami khin khe hawt sünta pe hanow ang chet pe tara nowm khai.<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />Naiawng che ang chang dowi hanow Thurai pur kowi tawng iawng chow ang nowng iowng kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Aia lünta ang mih khin khe tawng chow ang natek pe kown?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ang hai ang kowh naruüa kowi thawp miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">aia dow anging kowh u-uüa mu lak hownia thawp anging mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />“Ngarai miuüa kowi katpaw ang towkla akhawr dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">now mamaimowuüa kowi paw katpaw ang towkla tuak krat dowi.<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Ang kowh chakkham mih ang malowkchow ang lang cha dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">ang kowh chakkham mih saratchowuüa kowi paw ang pe chala reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Amatni kowi dow ang klanguüa chowng hownia pa iawng ang khetah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">now mamaimowuüa kowi dow chownglawng prat ang khowngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Tawnguat uowi dowi rakowi arua hown kawm mih che ang khila khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">ngaraima mih maru tengiow tengklaima uowi mih che ang khila khai hanow<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />amatni naruala dowi kownkow ruapur pawi hown kowh uan ang peah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">now amatni dow sak maiow hown pe ang prasi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Tara chet miia natangila ang kown mih ang tuk kowh saratchow kowi ang che kuanla kakat khai hanow<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />ang kowh bawng mih pangkawt hownia pacham tarai lah.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow Thurai narip kown mih kowi ang kram chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">Thurai dow kri kraingma pami ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />“Ang kowh pawisa tangka luk kowi katpaw ang owmsak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">ang kowh achangma mih kuh luk kowi ün katpaw ang owmsak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Ang kramah mih dawngthawnguan ahuma khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">nachenganchepaw naiawngün hown ang chang bawri dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Ang dow sat uang sawt mih kowi chupiia dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">now lama kowi paw ang tawi chupiia dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />Ang kowh sak dow naiawngün prakowi cham tawi tuak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">naiawngün kowi nachupiia kownkow ang kowh rut ang nam dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Naiawng ang che chang hanow Thurai kowh ripra kak tataingla mih angak ang chang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">now mukuang kowi kowh Thurai kowi ang tadata mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />“Ang kowh ransu-uüa piak mih khin khe ang piaw dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">amatni kawmkrat mih khin khe ang awmrawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi nakowngla kown mih piati ang pe dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">naiawng mih piati lai hown ang kowh nawr kowi ang pe changah angak dowi.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />‘Maru-uüa kowi tawmpa sakkrai aia pe mangah khai,’ pami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">ang kowh naruüa katpaw tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Prenlang maru-uüa dow tiama rawng kowi iak takla dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh kimplawt dow amatni vüi tauow hüah chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Akeng mih maru-uüa iawng ang kowh ngak ang pet dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">now sakdawng kowi paw ang kowh angak mih ang itah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Naiawng rakowi maru kowi ang kram dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">amatni nasui ang kown mih kowi kram kowh kim kowi ang uowi phülü dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />“Uh, ang kowh laiklow amia chünchü sünta ang dit panü!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ang kowh laiklow anowm pami takham se ang tek khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow pacham klang ang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">kingküa ang mih maru dow ang kowh angak ruiah now pacham tüngah lah.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Nami charam dow bawrima hown pangkawt kowi ang nadanah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">now nami dow lukruk iawng lu kowi ang nakrukah kown.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Ang changah mih maten Thurai kowi ang natek pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">aia pur kowi mang chapa iawng ang nakowkowi kown.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />“Ang kowh krawng bawn dow maru tut-e kowh ang cham kuah mih nadowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">nami krawng bawn dow ang cham kuah pami amiapaw naia me ang kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />Ang chaah mih chakkham sung laih iah kowi peah dowi kowi ang uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">nakowi kowh laih iah-uüa kowi dow sakkrai hown ang pe kowngah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />Ang che chang hanow nami laih kowi dow püm takcha chu mung pacham ru lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">now iakmow takcha mawh pacham awm lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:40">A-auiua sum ia kowi Jawb tek pe mih laiklow dow maiawng khowt now chur khai.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowh auiua sum ia kowi Elihu nangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Jawb mih aia mik kowi achinawmma pahai tatuak rengreng rakowi a-auiua sum ia dow klangah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Aia kowh angak taphuang dowi hai Thurai ripah mih anama pami Jawb tatuak dowi rakowi Elihu dow Jawb luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia dow Buzit chenchap kowi kowh Ram krungchak Barakel kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Jawb kowh auiua sum ia mih Jawb kowi nowng klangah dowi bowt rakowi Elihu dow Jawb kowh auiua sum ia luk kowi paw lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Aia dow Jawb kowh auiua sum ia mih lak-e lang sawi khai rakowi Jawb kowi naklangah kown mih tawi chawng phülü khai. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Akung kowi Jawb kowh auiua sum ia mih Jawb kowi nowng klangah dowi bowt mih khita hanow aia dow lainowmma kunmarau khai.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Naiawng rakowi Barakel kowh chapa Elihu tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 32:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Ang dow ning diachow taih tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">enni dow lawngtang khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">Naiawng rakowi ang tuakta iawng tawi tek kown mih ang uam dowi.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Ang tuak mih, ‘Ning lang hu miuüa phai pacham tek lai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">ning lang hu miuüa phai chanlaira lawnguan pacham tüngsang lah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Tawkchedow lusa maru tut-e Thurai kowh lümla uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">lang kri lang kraing mih kowh lümla chowtaih lusa maru kowi pe chanlaira reng.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Lawngtanguüa chowtaih nadowi chanlai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ning huma miuüa chowtaih nadowi nowm mih sia tuk.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Naiawng rakowi ang natek kown mih sünta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">ang paw ang tuakta mih laiklow ang natek kown.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />“Enni tek lai mih khin khe ang hawt chawng phülü chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">now tawng ngai chow enni tek mih ang hawt sünta phülü chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Enni tekah mih laiklow maten pe pe ching kaneu hanow ang hawt sünta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">Tawkchedow Jawb kowh laiklow tawi mih lowk ia paw enni nowng tüng pe dowi.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Naiawng rakowi, ‘A-i tut-e Jawb mih chanlaima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">Thurai towbowt aia kowi nowng klangah kown,’ pami hang tek büa diah.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Jawb tekah mih laiklow dow ang vüi nadowi; enni vüi chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi mih enni klangah iawng ang naklangah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />“Jawb, kowbüah dow ka laira dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">amatni dow sum kowh ha hüah towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Amatni dow nowng klang en dowi bowt kowh ririmma towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">Nachenganchepaw ang nachawng reng tak kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Kawmat dow ang paw natek lai bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">ang tuakta mih laiklow ang natawi tek bowt kown.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang natek kown mih uowi ahuma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ang kowh sak mih natek lai ngengche kownkow tatuak khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Ang kowh sak dow grep tui tek lai bowt kowh tathek ngialia mih im iawng towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">nami dow chak pik hown kowh im sar tathek kown chowbowt mih iawng towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Ang kowh sak naklamla kownkow ang natek lai kown takla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">kowpta nawr phülü dowi bowt kowi ang natek lai kown takla khowk.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Ang dow mia prakowi paw natangi kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">now mia kowi paw kiow nowm ang nakiowah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Ang dow kiow nowm paw maru kowi ang tuk kiow dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">now ang che kiow nowm nadowi mih hown ang krawi kiow hanow alenma Thurai narip ang kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Elihu nangah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />“Jawb, kawmat dow ang kowh laiklow sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">ang natek en kown mih kowi pe ching kaneu diah.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Kawmat dow ang sak kowi uowi mih laiklow ang natek bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">ang kowh laiklow mih dai chem kowi mown klowlow towbowt.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Ang kowh laiklow dow achangma mih sak hownia uang lawt mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ang tuk mowr mih ang kowh nawr anowmma natek kown.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Thurai kowh lümla mih thawp ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">lang kri lang kraing mih kowh kawli pe ang singra khai.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />“En che ia hanow ang natek kown mih kowi klang ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">en naklangla ang kown mih laiklow kamrütta kaneu diah.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Thurai pur kowi dow en hai ang mih katsang taih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">ang kowi paw en kowi iawng bawn hown chowtaih thawp ang khai.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Naiawng rakowi hauang kram ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">en sak kowi raula iawng mih laiklow ang natek kown nadowi.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />“En tekah mih maten ang ta bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ang pur kowi en tek mih maiawng,<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />‘Ang dow chimsaima, ang kowh dow angak uowi dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">ang dow achinawmma, ang kowh dow aprek uowi dowi.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai mih cham ang aprek khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">aia dow nüla ang ransu khai.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Aia dow lawngha leng hown klowng kowi khuowk ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ang kowh mangra maten kowi kaneuma pe ching khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />“Tawkchedow naiawng en tek mih mapaw taka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow maru lak-e lang kri kraing chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Lusa maru chawk lai mih kowi Thurai klang dowi pahai en tek khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng Thurai kowi kingküala mih lai en tuk tek khai?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Thurai dow achaing alang alangma lusa maru tut-e uang tek lai reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">Tawkchedow naiawng Thurai uang tek lai mih hawt tuk mat bowk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Aia dow uarmang kowi hai mukmang kowi krawi tek lai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">now uar-e maru müi su thüm khe krawi tek lai reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Aia dow maru param ria kowi krawi tek laisin reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">now nauowi kaneu kown mih laiklow tata now maru-uüa mih lainowmma kram reng.<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Naiawng aia krawi tek mih dow pacham towta lup ngak chang lah pakowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">now hang pacham chang bawri tham bowt lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Naiawng hai aia dow napiak kown mih hownia krawi lawng maru reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">now nakowng kown mih hownia krawi pe plai reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />“Tawngbak khe dow arau dikma hown aia hawi a-i reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">now pabuk pakowma arau hown a-i uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />Nakhowk khe dow a-i mih ka chakkham sowr dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">now chakkham lang iung mih kowi khowm a-i sui lawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Nakhowk khe dow arawngma a-i phaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">now a-i buk kowi mih hut kangowh tatüng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Nakhowk khe dow tadupra kuam ria kowi a-i cham ting reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">now a-i kowh chownglawng mih makowng kramamu-uüa hown tatawn reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />“Thurai tut-e dow naiawng mih maru kowi nowng lawng mih kramamu uowi athawng aiawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">Kramamu lowk ia dow, ‘Nami maru dow maru iung chowtaih,’ pahai tek chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Nahanow kramamu nasana hanow natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Nami maru kowi aklan mih maru uowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">Naiawng rakowi nami maru kowi pe singah reng diah,’ napa kown.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Nahanow nami maru dow kow naiung iawk kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">now aia kowh dow klanguüa kow iawng naphaw iawk kown.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Aia dow Thurai kowi nachupiia hanow Thurai mih aia kowi nasanaah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">aia dow nakhi Thurai lumowr hanow awmrawm kowh nahow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">Thurai dow aia kowi mih achinawmma pahai nadowkah iawk kown.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Nakhowk khe dow maru-uüa tut-e uangah hanow aia natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Ang changta angak khai, now nadowi mih lup ang changta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:27">Nachenganchepaw ang kak taing mih ripra Thurai pe ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Thurai dow kowngra tiama prakowi mang mih hownia uang lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh chownglawng mih anowi hown tek khai iawk,’ napa kown.<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29-30" />“Kowngra pra mang mih hownia nauang planla kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29-30">now chownglawng kowi asowrma naia uowila kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29-30">Thurai dow lusa maru vüi aplan aplan naiawng chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />“Jawb, ang laiklow mih pe pe ching kaneu hanow ririmma sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang natek kown mih uowi küng tak.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />En natek kown mih che uowi khai hanow tek ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en achinawmma pami nachün kown ang nau.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Tawkche tawngpaw tek kown en kowh uowi dowk hanow ang laiklow ririmma sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">chanlaira lawnguan ang natüngsang en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Nami kung kowi Elihu plan tek pe auiuauüa mih,<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Chanlaima miuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">prengia uowima miuüa low, ang laiklow kowi pe param büa diah.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow dai dow tang kan sowr reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">nami iawng param paw maru kowh laiklow chaing reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Naiawng rakowi uang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">amia kowh laiklow chow thik mih a-i chaingah madiah sik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">amia kowh laiklow chow lang iung mih a-i sam chamah madiah sik.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />“Jawb tek mih, ‘Ang dow achinawmma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">Tawkche Thurai dow chet ang tara nowm dowi.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Ang tek lainowm chepaw amatni dow nüla ang daila khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">ang chang ngak dowi chepaw iung dowi mih arau ang ka khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />“Sam tek büah madiah! Jawb iawng mih maru uowi ne tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">Aia dow atungma Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi mih lai tek khai.<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Aia dow chang lup ngak miuüa hown tawi taiua reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">now maru ngakuüa hown paw aia dow tawi taiua reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Jawb tek mih, ‘Thurai kowi sak-ihra pek dow mrawkra uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">pe sak-ihah chepaw aia dow tawngpaw naka kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />“Prengia uowima miuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow katpaw chang ngak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Thurai dow maru changah mih lup iawng peah asung reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">maru kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng aia dow peah sung reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Thurai dow katpaw chang ngak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow chet tara nowm reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Thurai kowi dow nakruitown lusa kown mih kurdik amiapaw peah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">palusama naming nakhet kown mih lup paw aia kowi amiapaw peah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Aia che aia tekta mih laiklow iawng chang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">now aia peah mih lümla hai kawli paw aia pawta khai hanow,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />lusa maru dow alenma nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">now amatni dow naplan chowng dinchow iawk kown.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />“Enni kowh che prengia uowi hanow mami laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">now ang tek lai mih khin khe ang kowh laiklow kowi pe param büa diah.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Thurai che tara nowm kowi sui khai e dow nowngia kruitown pren kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Achinawmma mih hai akürma mih Thurai kowi enni napeah angak kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Aia dow manguüa kowi tek pe mih, ‘Enni dow asung uowi mih maru chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">Now aluchowuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, ‘Enni dow tachi tanawm dowi mih maru chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Aia dow pren kruitown miuüa prakowi tawi tangila dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ngaraima miuüa kowi lak-e kurengma miuüa kowi aia lang sakrauah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni bowkbowk dow aia kowh uanh thawp chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Amatni dow mingmang dowi khe ün kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">now uar dawng uar kak khe ün kowng reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">Akürma miuüa khowm padow aiawnglowma kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />“Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow tawng chow maru chang mih krawi tang mü reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">amatni kowh khawk san lawi khowm aia krawi tang mü reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Thurai tut-e dow maru ngakuüa kowh aiiuma mih tapetra uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">now maru ngakuüa tapetla kown mih aiiuma mih anim paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Thurai kowh dow chaing maru kown mih akhin khowm kla dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">aia vüi dow lusa maru kowi nachet pe tara kown mih khin khowm bowkta mih uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Aia dow mia kowi paw lüntala dowi matchang akürma miuüa kowi piakah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">now amatni takcha kowi akeng miuüa kowi aia towah aluchow reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni changah mih lup ngak ingsap dow aia towah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow iak-e khe ün aia piakah reng.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni kowi aia ripah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">amatni kowi dow maru pur kowi aia ripah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow aia tiama kowi mang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">now aia kowh ana pek prakowi pe ching büa dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Amatni krawi chang nowng rakowi ngarai miuüa kowh kar klow dow Thurai tut-e kowting khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">nahanow ngarai miuüa kowh kar klow dow Thurai hawt sünta pe khai.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Ririmma aia uowi chepaw aia kowi dow amiapaw ia peah ngak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">aia che petta lumowr hanow aia kowi dow amiapaw khi-ah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Nachenganchepaw aia dow maru hai chenchapuüa luk kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Naiawng Thurai chang mih dow aia kowi kowh ringkaw dowi miuüa hang pacham kruitown pren lah pakowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">now maru kowi mih tiama ngak prakowi hang pacham nowng pawla lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />“Ang kowh ngak rakowi ang ka ripra khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">Naiawng rakowi ang chang ngak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Ang tukah dowi mih lawnguan dow tüngsang ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ang changta angak khai hanow ang nachang kown nadowi bowt,” pami</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:32">Thurai kowi miapaw tek pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />“Jawb, en dow Thurai kowi nuata khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">nami kowi en nau iawng tawng iawng chow Thurai nape en awmrawm sung kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Saktuak anikma nauowi kown mih dow en kowh lup chekhai; ang kowh lup nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">Naiawng rakowi tawng chow en tuak mih phai tek ang diah.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Prengiama miuüa dow maiawng natek ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">now chanlaima mih maru-uüa paw maiawng natek ang kown,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Jawb dow prengia uowi dowi mih maru iawng prow sang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">aia tekah mih laiklow dow auan uowi dowi chekhai,’ napa kown.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Jawb tekah mih laiklow maten dow chaingah e naiung kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh laiklow dow maru ngakuüa kowh laiklow iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Aia dow aia changah mih angak klen kowi Thurai kowi kingküaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">aia dow a-i pur kowi Thurai kowi peah rukrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">now Thurai kowi kingküala mih laiklow paw ahuma tek khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Nami kung kowi Elihu plan tek pe Jawb mih,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Jawb, Thurai mik kowi en kowh aprek uowi dowi pahai en tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">naiawng en tek mih en tuak kowi dow taka tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />En tek pe mih, ‘Achinawmma ang uowi mih tawng chow maratra uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">Ang chang angak dowi mih sung tawng chow ang naka kown?’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />“Kawmat dow ang naklang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">now en auiuauüa kowi paw ang naklangah kown.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Mukuang prakowi awr tang mü akat madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">now en luk kowi mün khowt chow uangnim lowng mih mü madiah.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />En changta lup ngak pache tawng chow Thurai own kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Aplan aplan en tawita lup khai pache tawng chow Thurai own kown?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Achinawmma en uowi chepaw Thurai vüi tawng chow maratra uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">En chang lup iung chepaw en hownia tawngpaw Thurai ka dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />En chang lup ngak chepaw lusa maru chowtaih piak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">now en chang lup iung chepaw lusa maru chowtaih marat reng.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />“Maru nowng changra krüa kowi uowi khe maru kar reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">akürma mih maru-uüa rut hownia naplaila kownkow maru lü khowng reng.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Tawkchedow thawpah miia Thurai kowi miapaw haw dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">‘Uar-e kowh awmrawmra meng pe ang mih Thurai tawng kowi chow?<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />Aia dow lusa kowi kowh asaduauüa kowi lak-e tüngsang a-i khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">now kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber hawmh kowi lak-e pe a-i chanlaira khai,’ pami miapaw tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Aia tut-e maru awr nguk awr kar khe Thurai dow klangah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow bawrima hai angakma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Amatni dow Thurai tut-e awr nguk awr kar chepaw tawngpaw mrawk dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni awr lü mih Thurai sünta pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />“Jawb, aia kowi en khi-ah dowi padow en tek khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">Nachenganchepaw en che chawngah now aia mih nachet en tara nowm kown.<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Aia dow kunmarauma hown maru ngak kowi ripah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">now maru ngak prakowi khowt pat pe ching dowi pami paw en tek chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Naiawng en tek mih dow asung uowi dowi mih laiklow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">now tawng chow en tek mih en matia khowm tuk dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu plan tek iawk mih,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Thurai takcha kowi ang natek kown mih uowi ne tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown sünta büah nawngchow diah.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Ang chownglawng kowi chanlaira ahuma khowk ang ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">nami hownia thawp ang miia achinawmma pami ang natüng enni kown.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Ang natek enni kown mih laiklow dow anowmma kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">chanlaira atekma mih maru enni pur kowi tawi uowi lowk ia chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />“Thurai dow kri kraingma chepaw lusa maru kowi mia kowi paw suiah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">aia dow aia nau changah kown mih tuakta iawng chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Aia dow maru ngakuüa kowi towah sing dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">Tawkchedow nowng changra kowi uowi miuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm reng.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Aia dow maru iunguüa hownia cham lang dang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">aia dow naiawng mih maru-uüa kowi manguüa hown pe taiua chowmah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">now amatni kowi dow achowngma vüi peah ringkawra reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Nachenganchepaw lusa maru che angak hown tatawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">now amatni che kham ngare khai hanow,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />tawng angak chow amatni changta mih Thurai tüng pe reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">bawrima hown amatni chang lup ngak mih dow Thurai tüng pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Aia dow natowta lup ngak chang kownkow amatni kowi peah prengia iung reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">now angak hownia nauang plan kownkow amatni kowi aia peah ana reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Nakhowk khe amatni che aia laiklow chün hai aia tek iawng chang khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">lup chawn reng hai chownglawng kowi asowrma ka uowi büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Nachenganchepaw amatni che aia laiklow sünta dowi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">chanlaira uowi dowi rakowi saidawng rut kowi nakowng büah kown.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />“Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi miuüa dow atungma hing kunmarauta hüah chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">amatni dow amatni kowi Thurai ripah khe nalü khowng kownkow kar dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Amatni dow klanguüa reng tak khe kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">amatni dow sürlawkma mih chownglawng sun thüm khe chowng chur reng.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow amatni kowi pe khamah ngare mih hownia lawngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">aia dow amatni kowh angak pacham tuk lah pakowh akawm akrat hown maru kowi tüngsangah reng.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />“Jawb, Thurai mih akrat pusara hownia nalawtla en kown nau chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">aia dow thaulangma mih arah kowi natow en kown nau chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">Nakowi dow en kowh pawitang mih chakkham iung atekma nauowi kown.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow maru ngakuüa iawng en ka ripra khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">Thurai mih en kak taing iawng rip en mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Kaneu diah, en kunmarau rakowi Thurai kowi hangkow changla rensi kau diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">en kowh dawngthawnguan ahuma mih angak prakowi hangkow pacham pawla en lah.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />En kowh dow dawngthawnguan hai nowng changra kür ahuma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">naiawngün mih akrat pusara hownia nowng lawng en dowi.<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Uar nauang tamum klum kown mih kowi hangkow prüa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru piak reng mih dow uar-e khe chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Kaneu diah, angak prakowi hangkow plan diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">angak hownia nahen en kownkow Thurai pe ngare en mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />“Thurai dow lowra nowng chang miia chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">aia iawng mih tüngsang mih dow miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Aia kowi dow tawng chow achang takla mih miapaw nowng tek pe dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">‘En changah mih lup tawi khai,’ pami miapaw nowng tek pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Aia changah mih lup rakowi aia kowi kiowah kown mih hangkow tamata diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">aia kowi dow aia kowh lup rakowi meng hown maru kiowah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Maru maten dow aia kowh lup khi bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">Tawkchedow naiawngün mih alakma hownia khi mih chowtaih.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />“Thurai dow mün khowt chow kri kraing mih a-i nowng tuk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">now aia dow mün ning khowk chow mih paw a-i nowng tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Aia dow lusa kowi kowh tui pawah hanow uangnim kowi towah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">now naiawngün tui kowi dow aia mih pe chowngah uangchak reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Nami uangchak dow uangnim hownia lusa kowi uang iu dowh reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">now nami uang tui dow lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten maratla reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Uangnim kowi tawng iawng chow aia dauta hüah mih miapaw tuk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">now aia uowi rah hownia tawng iawng chow muk tün mih paw miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Aia dow aia tavir lut pla kowi pe nowiah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">Nachenganchepaw sata kowi dow aiiuma aia towah reng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sata kowi dow aiiuma aia towah reng </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown arui uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Aia dow naiawng hown pe a-i uang tui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">now naiawngün uang tui hownia luprak ahuma pe ka a-i reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Aia dow pla nowi kowi aia rut hown dowkah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">now aia nauah mih re-e pla kowi aia krawi pe nowiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Aia kowh muk tün dow uang nauang kown mih satang rik phowng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">Naiawng rakowi asaduauüa paw uang nauang kown mih satang tawi tuk reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Elihu plan tek mih, “Naiawngün ang tuak hanow kram kowh ang chür reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">now ang kowh sak mih takrow lai kowh thü dukluk reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Muk tün iawng mih Thurai kowh klow dow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">aia nawr hownia kowh uang lawt mih klow sünta büa diah.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Aia dow mukuang dak kowi pla nowi uang pe nowiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">now nami pla nowi dow palusama kowi aia krawi pe nowiah khai.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Pla nowi kung kowi dow muk tün klow taah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">nami klow dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai hownia kowh klow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Naiawng aia tüng klow mih khin khe pla nowi mih aia taingta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Thurai dow awdara uowima hown tüng klow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">aia changah mih kri kraingma mih lup dow a-i tuk bowk dowi.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Aia dow nangkhe kowi mih lusa kowi aia pe klaah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">now uang kowi paw lusa kowi aia pe uangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Naiawng hai Thurai dow maru kowh lup chang taingta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">naiawng hai aia kowh nowng changra lawnguan lusa maru kowi aia pe tukah khai.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Nami khin khe tawncher hawmh dow amatni kowh khawng lak kowi kup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">now amatni kowh khawng lak kowi tanai büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Liku uangchak dow mrawkphak hownia uang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">now tawngphak hownia dow li uang pawla arua reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Thurai kowh kawli hown dow nangkhe uang chowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">aia kowh kawli hown dow tui uang takhe reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Thurai dow uangnim kowi tui atekma changah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">aia dow uangnim dawng kowi pla krawi pe nowiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Aia kowh ana hown uangnim dow krawi iow reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">now naiawngün dow aia kowh ana pek nachün kownkow palusama kowi krawi iow reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Uang kowi aia uang chin mih dow lusa kowi tui nauowila kownkow chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">nami dow aia narip maru kownkow nadowi now natüng pe achur uowi dowi mih sakraura kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />“Jawb, mami laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">Thurai changah mih awdara lup lawnguan kaneuma tuakah diah.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Tawng iawng chow uangnim kowi Thurai kruitownah mih en tuk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">Tawng iawng chow pla kowi Thurai pe nowiah mih en tuk bow?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Tawng iawng chow mukuang kowi uangnim tapowng mih en tuk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">Tawng iawng chow Thurai kowh awdara uowima mih lup en tuk bow?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Mrawkphak hownia kowh li den hown dow lusa rüp reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">Nakhowk khe dow en khupah mih tawnguat kowi uang den mih en tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Mukuang dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih nimrua iawng akhawtma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">nami mukuang Thurai thawp mih khin khe en tawi khowngah tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />“Tawng iawng chow Thurai kowi anging naklangah kown mih tek anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">anging kowh prengia uowi dowi rakowi tawng iawng chow aia kowi natek pe kown mih anging tuk dowi.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Thurai hown taklang kown mih ang lü dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Tawngplawng kowchow aia napiak ang kown mih khin ang napeah kown?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />“Li hutta uangnim hanow mukuang dow achimma uang phaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">now nami hownia dow sat nowi tawk pluplup uang sawt reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:21">Nakhowk khe nami sat nowi kowi dow amiapaw nowng mü dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Tawngphak hownia Thurai kowh kraingra dow kuh iawng uang sawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">now aia riaret kowi dow aia kowh kramra uowima mih kraingra khi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai kowh kürra dow a-i nowng tuakah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">aia dow anowmma hai achinawmma chepaw piak a-i dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow aia kowi ringkawma hown kramah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">kowmatia kowi tanü chanlai miuüa prakowi dow aia pe ching dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow liku uangchak dawng hownia Jawb kowi uang klangah khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Prengia uowi dowi mih laiklow tek mih mia chow en?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ang kowh chanlaira owm dowi mih mia chow en?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Jawb, tasen kiakma mih maru iawng kamrütma hown uowi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang nalünta en kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">now ang lünta en mih iawng en naklang ngengche kown.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />“Ang thawp lusa chüng mih khin khe tawng kowi chow en uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">En kowh che prengia uowi hanow sam tek ang madiah.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Lusa mün khowt chow iuk kown mih mia chow khowm bowk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Now akhai müa leng hown nami lusa mia chow krawi khai?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Lusa chüng maten tawng luk kowi chow ang phükah?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Now nami achüng phükra kowi mia chow rik phük hua?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Nami khin khe dow rauleng krek ün ahawmsang tek meng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">now mukuang kramamu-uüa paw piaw se how büah chowdiah.<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />“Krawng dawng hownia sata tui uang lawt mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">sata navela dowi kownkow amia chow thawp sata pang?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Nami khin khe sata kowi dow ang khup pe uangnim khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">now aia kowi dow aiiuma hown ang tungah khai.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Sata rihi dow ang khowm bowkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">now sata tui kowi mih rihi uat kowi ang pe ueah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />Sata kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Mami mowr taih en naia hawr kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">nami klen kowi dow en naia hawr kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:11">En kowh bawrira tuilowng mih mami re-e en taingta kown takla,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />“En chownglawng kowi ni nauown kown mih en peah ana kakat tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">Now uar nathowi kown mih en peah ana kakat tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Palusama kowi anowi nasawt hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">maru ngakuüa napowtla kownkow ni nowi kowi en peah ana kakat tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Ni nowi hown dow hungh hai lawngrawi ün achimma khi-ah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">nami dow dawnguan klep ia iawng hai suplawk kowi tuk mur mih iawng achimma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Maru ngakuüa dow naukhi ni nowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">amatni dow ni nowi kowi chang lup ngak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />“Sata uang uown phawla mih arah kowi en kowkowi khowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">Now sata thing kowi kowh re phai kowi en kowtawi mang khowk bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Makowng pren kowh tapplawt en khi khowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Makowng pren tapplawt tawng kowi chow en tuk bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Mün khowt chow lusa iuk mih en tuk tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Naiawngün che en tuk now sam tek ang madiah.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />“Tawng hownia chow anowi uang ting?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Tawng prakowi chow aiiu cham mang?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Amatni uowi rah kowi amatni kowi en naia pawla iawk kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Amatni uowi rah kowi kowkowila kown mih tiama en tuk bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Naiawngün ang thawp mih dow en aiawng tuk towbowt manow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün thawpta bowk dowi rawn en uang dia khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">now en uanla hu lai bowt rakowi en tukah mih hu krang chur khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />“Nangkhe tanungra kowi en tawi kup khowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">ria klu tanungra en khi khowk bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />Naiawngün dow krat mih khin khe kowh vüi ang nungah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">tasen hai tatu tasawt mih khin khe natawngah kown mih vüi ang krümah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Tawng hownia chow anowi uang ting mih en tuk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">Tawng hownia chow lusa kowi satlawt li uang mih en tuk bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />“Uangchak mang nauangla kown mih tiama mia chow thawp?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">liku hai muk tün kaikreng nauangla kown mih tiama thawp mih mia chow?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Akhaw aklaima mih süng kowi pe uangah uang mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">Maru uowiah dowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi pe uangah uang mih mia chow?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Kangkhawngma mih krawng kowi pe kaah tui mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">Now krawng hownia pram kowi pe ruah mih mia chow?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />“Uang kowh pa uowi khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Amia chow thawp nang tui?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Mia chow nangkhe kowi nowng thawp mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Mukuang hownia kowh nang kowi uang pe klaah mih mia chow?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Tui dow chowng nangkhe hanow hua iawng akhawtma phaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">now nami nangkhe dow sata luk kowi tapowng hüah reng.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />“Rauleng krek ün kowi arasang en ia town kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Tatu lawmlawm mih krek ün en ia prai kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Mukuang kowi kowh krek kowi amatni lawt khin khe en ia pe lawtah kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">Tawm pami krek hai achauüa kowi en ia kruitown kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Mukuang kowi kowh ari aiang en tuk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Nakruitownla lusa kownkow naiawngün en naia tawng kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />“Uangnim kowi en hek pe hanow uang kowi en nowng pe uangah bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />En nauah mih arah kowi pla kowi en ia pe nowiah kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Now en chinah mih arah kowi amatni kownowi kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Amia chow maru kowi peah prengia?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">Amatni kowh sak kowi amia chow peah chanlaira?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Nowng rüala uangnim pat mih prengia mia kowh chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">khük tuikawng tui iawng mukuang hownia nowng pe uang mih mia chow?<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Naiawng nowng chang mih hownia dow dinchow chowng suplawk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">now bawn klu ün paw chowng suplawk nek reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39-40" />“Krangsila hawmh dow puk kowi tapet reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39-40">now amatni dow pram mung kowi kram chak kownkow hawt tapet reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:39-40">Nakhowk khe amatni vüi en kram pe chak tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39-40">Now amatni chak sakkrai khe en peah chakkham tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 38:39-40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Thurai tut-e uaak chauüa uang kar mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">chakkham khawr hown mapra paipra krawi mangla pang mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">amatni kowi mia chow kram pe chakkham reng?” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />“Kaurawng kowi ngaia pen mih khin en tuk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Naki ma pen mih en khi kakat tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Mu lak kowi mün ni chow amatni kowh chah uowi mih en rüaah tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Now amatni pen chah mih khin en tuk tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Amatni dow han chungchow uowiah now pen chah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">now ki penta chah hanow amatni kowh mu rau dow rim reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Amatni kowh chah dow akuangma mih dowm kowi awr iuk awr sown reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">amatni kowh chah dow iuk khowk hanow u hownia cham lang powt reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />“Kaurawng kawrngaramchük kowi peah thaulangra mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Amatni kowi khuowkla mih leng latta pe mih mia chow?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Amatni kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang towah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">amatni kowi dow a-ikma mih krawng kowi ang pe uowiah khai.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Amatni dow marow kowi kowh tünteu hownia alakma kowi cham uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">now amatni kowi pe changah lup mih maru kowh hek klow paw ta büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Amatni kowh tawkra dow hungma mawngma süng kowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">amatni dow hungma mawngma kowi krawi cham pram reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />“Chiarowngla kowi en pe changah lup e nachang en kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Amatni dow uar-e khe chia rum lak kowi nauowi en kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Amatni kowi dow laih kowi kowh laih thawn tim kowi en naia khuowk kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Amatni dow en vüi kowi nathawn en lawngrawi kown pe bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Amatni kowh kür ahuma mih luk kowi en naowmsak kown pe bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">En kowh adikma mih lup amatni kowi en nape changah kown pe bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Laih kowi kowh cha kim kowi amatni nauang pawla en luprak kown pe bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">Naiawng amatni nachang en kown mih amatni luk kowi en owm tak bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />“Ut uaklinguüa dow akür akürma klup lap reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">Tawkche amatni dow tuipai khowt khowm nowng iow dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Ut uaklinguüa dow krawng kowi cham duita hüah now powt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">now amatni kowh dui dow se kowi pe denah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Amatni dow amatni kowh dui kowi akeng miuüa nanünta lowmow pami tuak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">now kaurawng uaramchak hawmh nateuta lowmow pami paw tuak büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Ut uaklinguüa dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi amatni kowh chah nadowi iawng nüla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa kowng now amatni kawm iawm mih ka tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow Thurai pela chanlaira dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">now tukra paw amatni kowi dow Thurai pela dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Nachenganchepaw klupla lap se iowm khe dow amatni mih lainowmma len chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kawrnga alenma mih luk kowi kowh chowm mih kowi renah reng.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />“Jawb, kawrnga kowi peah kür mih en chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">Now amatni kowh ngowngsowng pawi klangiungma mih paw en chekhai bow peah?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Amatni kowi plawng iawng nowng pe chetah mih en chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">Amatni kowh nakawng hownia bawrima mih klow dow kramra uowima chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Amatni dow akür akürma rowt khawk hanow amatni kowh kür hown piaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">now tasen mih khin khe amatni dow cham dowk tasen reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Amatni dow kram pami hing tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">Naiawng rakowi saidawng pur hownia paw süt büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Amatni buk kowi kowh tauai hüah mih leba sek rowng dow tasowk krawkrawk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">now amatni luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphai kowh leba sek hai reh dow tawk pluplup reng.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Amatni dow sak denma khe kowh iawng chür klukluk se iowm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">ta baw tün hanow amatni dow nowng uowi phülü dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Baw tün hown krowksang amatni dow nakawng hownia chang atün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">now siphai aluchow kowh tasen hawk klow hai tasen nam paw ta büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />“Mrawkphak prakowi naiow kownkow mukaichow mih iang lap reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">naiawng mukaichow tuk iow mih en sangah kowh chekhai bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Alowngma kowi pat uamu iow reng mih en peah ana kowh bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">Now alowngma mih arah kowi uamu chang bai mih paw en peah ana kowh bow?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Amatni dow rak arema mih rah kowi cham uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">now uar-e khe dow rak luk kowi cham uowi büah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:28">Rak dow amatni kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Amatni dow rak luk hownia krawi tang mü chakkham reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">amatni kowh mik dow alakma hownia khi chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow aduma pat cha vi reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">amatni kowi dow uak uowi rah re-e khi-ah reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Nami kung kowi Jawb kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe mih,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Ang dow lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Tawkche en dow, ‘En tawi,’ pahai uang taüala ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:2">Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow uang klang ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Ang dow asung uowi dowi mih maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Naiawng rakowi tawng iawng chow ang naklang en kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:4">Ang natek lai dowi bowt kownkow rut hown ang pumta nawr khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Ang nau tek en kown mih laiklow maten ang tekta bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">Naiawng rakowi ang natekah kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Thurai klangah iawk mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Nakhowk khe liku dawng hownia Jawb kowi CHAKRAMANG uang klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Jawb, tasen kiakma mih maru iawng kamrütma hown uowi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang nalünta en kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">now ang lünta en mih iawng en naklang ngengche kown.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Ang kowh tara nowm en tadata kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">En achinawmma pami natüngah kownkow en nape ang angak kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Thurai kowh iawng en kowh kür uowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">En kowh klow Thurai kowh klow iawng bow?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />“Nahanow kiowrira hai kraingra hown kowmatia kowi tawngah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">now ringkawra hai kiowrira mih tawnguat iawng khupah diah.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />En kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow maru ngakuüa luk kowi khükah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">bawrima miuüa kowi dow khamsum khamdawma towah diah.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Bawrima miuüa maten kowi dow pe kaah rukrai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">maru ngakuüa kowi dow amatni uowi rah kowi piakah diah.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Amatni bowkbowk kowi dow tadupra kowi dupah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">amatni kowi dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi towah diah.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Naiawng che en ia chang khai hanow maiawng ang nakiow en kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">en dow en kowh kür hown en nowngia talawng khai nowm.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />“Aiukma mih kaurawng uaramchak prakowi tang mü diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">ang thawp en iawng aia kowi ang thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">now aia dow chia iawng cha pram reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Aia kowh kelang kowi dow kür kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">aia mu kowi kowh nga kowi paw kür kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Aia kowh mai dow sidar singh iawng akhawtma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">now aia kowh thung nga paw akhawtma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Aia hut ün dow kri lawng iawng akhawtma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">aia kowh khawk dow lawngha dung iawng akhawtma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Aia dow Thurai uanh thawp maten kowi kowh lang kür mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">aia kowi kowh nowng sai mih dow aia kowi thawp miia chowtaih.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Aia kowi dow hungh ün peah chakkham reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">nakowi kowh uowi mih kaurawng uaramchak hawmh maten nakowi ngawk reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Ri singh tut kowi aia dow mawk phulu reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">now aw pang kowi kowh uaklung taw kowi mawk reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Aia kowi dow ri singh peah klim reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">now aw pang kowi kowh aram chakma mih singh paw peah klim reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Tui lawt chepaw aia dow kram dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">Jawrdan aw tui aia lumowr kowi uang ting chepaw aia dow powt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Aia kowh mik dow achürma rakowi aia kowi miapaw nowng khüm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">chak pe leng chepaw aia kowi dow amiapaw nowng khüm dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="s">Jawb kowi Thurai plan tek pe küng mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Thurai plan tek mih, “<char style="w">Leviathan</char> kowi kuai hown en nowng küng kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">Now aia kowh nawr kowi leng hown en nowng tawm kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Aia kowh nakawng kowi en nowng phawk pe napha kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">Now kuai hown aia kowh awm ueng kowi en nowng uowk kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Aia kowi en nachangah naklak pakowh en tut-e aia nalü lawt kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Now aia kowi en napeah arau pakowh asamchow aia naklang en kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Chowngchowng saksakma aia kowi en nachangla nar kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">aia mih en hown natatow sangbowk laitawm kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Uakling hown ngawk iawng aia hown en nowng ngawk kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">Now en chauüa nangawkla kownkow aia kowi en nowng khuowk pe kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Aia kowh asung rakowi dam pawk miuüa nataüa prungrung kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Now aia kowh nga nacham sumah kownkow kun chang miuüa nataret kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Dam hür müa reh hown aia kowh pik en nowng plawn kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">Now aia kowh lu kowi happhe hown en nowng uowk kown bow?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Aia kowi che en krawi khüm hanow katpaw nowng tamata dowi mih tasen naphaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">nami hownia dow aia kowi nakrawi khüm kownkow katpaw en nacham tarü kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Aia kowi naia khüm kown mih sakowmra dow tawngpaw mrawk dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">aia kowi dow khi hown krowksang maru kowh sakkraingra khowk reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Aia kowi uam chang naklak mih maru miapaw uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">naiawng now ang pur kowi uam iowng mih mia chow uowi?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Rik pe ang rakowi ang napeah lai kown takla pami mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih srui dow ang kowh taih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />“Leviathan kowh buk lawnguan kowi ang natek en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">aia kowh kür hai aia kowh kow lawnguan kowi ang natek en kown.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Aia buk kowi kowh pik mia chow nowng kleu mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Now aia towkala buk mih pik nowng thek mih mia chow uowi?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Aia kowh nawr dow kramra uowima mih iüng kangowh tavir lut chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">naiawng iüng kangowh mih nawr uam ai kown mih mia chow uowi?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Aia kumlawng kowi kowh lip dow kawngma talüp hüah mih iawng taih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">naiawngün lip dow akhawtma tatawm bowk mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Now naiawngün lip dow abingma talüp mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">naiawngün lip takra hownia li khowm nowng kup dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Naiawngün lip dow lowkkowlowk tachawp bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">naiawngün lip dow lowk chowchi nowng krüaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />“Aia che sik hanow anowi uang lawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">now amik dow rau-e kowh sat nowi iawng tawk pluplup reng.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Aia nawr hownia dow maih lün bia laplap reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">now mairing maiiang rown prawn rawn reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Aia kowh nakawng hownia dow maikhük lawt iualua reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">nami maikhük dow towk pram mung khe kowh maikhük iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Aia hü sak khe kowh li hown dow mairing khowm lün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">now aia kowh nawr hownia dow maih lün bia laplap reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />“Aia kowh ngawngtung kowi dow lainowmma kür uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">aia kowi khi miuüa dow lainowmma kram rakowi powt reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Aia buk kowi kowh nga dow akhawtma tachek kowk mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">nami dow khawt lai bowt kowh tawngpaw chuk dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Aia kowh sak-uih dow huaklu iawng akhawtma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">Nami dow kawm küa müa huaklu iawng akhawtma chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Aia che awr rü hanow akürma miuüa paw kram reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">amatni dow kram lai kowh tawng chow achang takla mih tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Aia kowi dow saidawng hown sawtah chepaw tawngpaw own dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">now akeng mih rutchün khawkleng achukma mih hown hürah chepaw aia dow tawngpaw own dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Aia tut-e dow lawngha mih chahau iawng anümchow taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">now kri paw aia tut-e dow amawma mih singh iawng taih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Aia kowi dow tawng iawng mih leba sek paw nowng prütah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">iaiba hown kowh ap-ah mih huaklu kowi ngam tawngpaw aia klowkah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Lawngha dung hown bawpah chepaw aia dow ren lawt reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">lawngha dung hown bawpah mih aia tut-e chida kawng keu hown bawpah mih iawng taih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />“Aia mu pra kowh lip dow chuk krang nimrua sek iawng taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">Naiawng rakowi neng dawng kowi cham mang now laih thawn ia iawng phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Sata tui paw aia dow puh kowi kowh tuisa klawk burlur mih iawng changah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">now sata tui mih apawphupma aia changah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Aia mang kung kowi dow tawk pluplup tiama ta tachak rawkrawk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">nami aia mang kung kowi kowh tiama dow amük powm sam pau iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Lusa kowi kowh uowi mih chap maten aia hown tale mih tawngpaw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">aia kowi dow towla pe kramra dowi kowi thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Aia dow uanh thawp maiow kowi kowh lang bawri mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">aia dow kaurawng uaramchak maten kowh mang chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi Jawb klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi Jawb klangah mih,<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“En dow lowra sia nowng chang pami ang tuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">en kowi dow miapaw nowng hang en dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />En lünta ang mih, ‘Nami maru mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Ang kowh sangkrangra tuk dowi matchang tawng chow tek naklak?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">Ang tukah dowi mih lawnguan kowi ang tek naklak chekhai nowm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow ang tut-e awdara uowima chekhai.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />En tek ang mih, ‘Kawmat dow sünta diah, ang natek tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">ang nalünta en kown, now en mih naklang ang kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Alai khe dow en lawnguan kowi ta chowtaih ang ta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow ang matia mik hown ang khi en khai bowt.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Naiawng rakowi ang lai tawi mih maten rakowi ang uang lü alawt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">now ang tarip mih natüngla kownkow dinchow hai plawi dawng kowi ang chowm khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh achur laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Naiawngün laiklow maten Jawb ki tek kung kowi Teman chenchap Elifaz kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang kowh nar Jawb tek iawng en hai en auiuauüa dow ang lawnguan kowi anowmma tek dowi chekhai; naiawng rakowi enni luk kowi dow ang kowh kunmaraura mih lün pluplup khai. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih chiala ranit pum hai ruapurla ranit pum pawla hanow Jawb tut-e kowkowi büa diah, now enni matia vüi kowchang tikah mih uanap büa diah. Ang kowh nar Jawb mih enni vüi ang tut-e nauang lü lawt hanow ang nasünta pe kown, now enni <char style="w">buala</char> mih sung ang nape enni kown nadowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow ang lawnguan kowi ang kowh nar Jawb tek iawng enni tek dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Nakhowk khe Teman chenchap Elifaz, Suhite chenchap Bildad hai Namathite chenchap Zofar büah dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng rowprowp chang khai, now Jawb awr lü awr leng mih maten CHAKRAMANG hawt sünta pe khai.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Aia auiuauüa vüi ki chup Thurai kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow alai kowh aia chownglawng iawng Jawb kowi plan towah khai iawk; lowra chap kowi aia kowi dow alai kowh lak-e pre dungna CHAKRAMANG peah khai. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Aia kowh tainau-uüa, tuamowuüa hai aia hown tatuk miuüa maten mih aia kim kowi uang hanow aia hown taiua cha chakkham khai. Amatni dow aia luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG uang pawla pe akawm akratra mih maten rakowi aia kowi peah sakklamra khai. Amatni bowkbowk dow tai aklu chi hai kuh ramseng atawng chi aia kowi peah khai.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow Jawb kowi rik klenta mih chownglawng kowi kowh lak-e nami kung kowi kowh chownglawng kowi lang peah prasi khai. Aia kowh tawncher uowi mih dow ruapur 14,000 pum, ut 6,000 pum, chiala 2,000 pum hai kawrngaramchük 1,000 pum chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Aia dow plankut ka kachakuüa ranit ia hai masiuüa sum ia tak chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Aia kowh chama ata mih ming dow Jemima, adawng mih ming dow Kezia, now asawi mih ming dow Keren-Hapuk chekhai. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Nami khin khe dow nami pren kowi mih Jawb kowh chamauüa iawng klangiung mih masiuüa miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh rakmauüa kowi iawng apa retla pe dawngthawnguan khai.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Nami kung kowi paw Jawb dow singla 140 ning tak chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh chapa chamauüa kowh chu chah kowi tali chowng mowr tak khila khai. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Naiawng hai Jawb dow ning huma sing uowila now lawngtangma khowk khe kowng khai.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>